(2981037, 419055, 45021, '<td valign="top">Dramatic clouds and sea are good, not sure about the foreground.</td>', 'Dramatic clouds and sea are good, not sure about the foreground.', '2006-11-01 00:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981056, 420508, 45021, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dark and the eye doesn''t flow through the image easily.  The transitions are a bit too horizontal which form barriers to the eye moving through the image.  The inclusion of the bird is good.</td>', 'Seems a little dark and the eye doesn''t flow through the image easily.  The transitions are a bit too horizontal which form barriers to the eye moving through the image.  The inclusion of the bird is good.', '2006-11-01 00:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981059, 420491, 61318, '<td valign="top">ok, so it looks like you may have been in a bus, so I can understand not rolling down the window or getting out altogether...hell, this may even be near Chernobyl, so you wouldn''t have wanted to do either...but I don''t understand why you didn''t clone out the dust bunny.</td>', 'ok, so it looks like you may have been in a bus, so I can understand not rolling down the window or getting out altogether...hell, this may even be near Chernobyl, so you wouldn''t have wanted to do either...but I don''t understand why you didn''t clone out the dust bunny.', '2006-11-01 00:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981063, 419948, 64446, '<td valign="top">Off focus (maybe on purpose, but doesn''t work for me) and too blown up.<br/>You got into the wrong challenge, but I''m voting as it wasn''t.</td>', 'Off focus (maybe on purpose, but doesn''t work for me) and too blown up.You got into the wrong challenge, but I''m voting as it wasn''t.', '2006-11-01 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
