(2981380, 419289, 65779, '<td valign="top">Spectacular but I feel the colours are rather over-saturated in this case and the effect is a bit over the top.</td>', 'Spectacular but I feel the colours are rather over-saturated in this case and the effect is a bit over the top.', '2006-11-01 01:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981387, 420831, 15711, '<td valign="top">J''adore les couleurs!! Tres bien.<br/> <br/>Now - for a critique:  It''s tilted to the right just a smidge.</td>', 'J''adore les couleurs!! Tres bien. Now - for a critique:  It''s tilted to the right just a smidge.', '2006-11-01 01:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981399, 418064, 65779, '<td valign="top">Clever title - at least you didn''t submit to the wrong challenge  !!</td>', 'Clever title - at least you didn''t submit to the wrong challenge  !!', '2006-11-01 01:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981403, 420935, 64933, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and idea of this photograph but I think it is sharpened a bit too much to portray that relaxed feeling this subject should have.</td>', 'I really like the light and idea of this photograph but I think it is sharpened a bit too much to portray that relaxed feeling this subject should have.', '2006-11-01 01:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981410, 420172, 64933, '<td valign="top">This picture utterly confuses me, but it is cool on a twisted way.</td>', 'This picture utterly confuses me, but it is cool on a twisted way.', '2006-11-01 01:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981418, 418659, 64933, '<td valign="top">Good job on the title and I really like the interesting subjust you used.</td>', 'Good job on the title and I really like the interesting subjust you used.', '2006-11-01 01:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981427, 420455, 65779, '<td valign="top">I personally would have cropped off the grass in front.</td>', 'I personally would have cropped off the grass in front.', '2006-11-01 01:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981441, 419496, 65779, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge unfortunately</td>', 'Wrong challenge unfortunately', '2006-11-01 01:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981444, 420514, 64933, '<td valign="top">What a great subject! The color contrast makes the way the road curves stand out so much more. It''s very curious though how the trees over all those leaves all have green leaves and seem as if they have lost none. I love how in the distance it looks misty. It would have enhanced it further if the leaves were sharpened a little more. Wonderful job.</td>', 'What a great subject! The color contrast makes the way the road curves stand out so much more. It''s very curious though how the trees over all those leaves all have green leaves and seem as if they have lost none. I love how in the distance it looks misty. It would have enhanced it further if the leaves were sharpened a little more. Wonderful job.', '2006-11-01 01:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981463, 421039, 65779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-11-01 02:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981532, 419790, 47316, '<td valign="top">Sneaky, sneaky! Really interesting shot. I''ll buy it but I dunno how others are gunna feel!<br/> <br/>Your title lost me but I got what you meant.</td>', 'Sneaky, sneaky! Really interesting shot. I''ll buy it but I dunno how others are gunna feel! Your title lost me but I got what you meant.', '2006-11-01 02:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981545, 420190, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s sweet :-) Very striking image. I''d have considered applying a smidgeon of gradient to the sky from the top down to contain it a little, but that''s just my style really.</td>', 'That''s sweet :-) Very striking image. I''d have considered applying a smidgeon of gradient to the sky from the top down to contain it a little, but that''s just my style really.', '2006-11-01 02:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981548, 420499, 30861, '<td valign="top">Bad color throw to green in the near-horizon sky and the high clouds mars this otherwise very serene image.</td>', 'Bad color throw to green in the near-horizon sky and the high clouds mars this otherwise very serene image.', '2006-11-01 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981576, 420413, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s lovely the way the grass fronds are leaning in towards the center to accentuate the triangular nature of the dominant composition. It''s sort of "leading shapes" instead of "leading lines". The touch of mist on the water in the background is a sublime grace note. I''m less enthusiastic about the dominance of the foreground. I understand what you''re after, but there''s a little too much of it IMO. I''d crop up to just under the left end of the near stick, I think, but it''s a tough one. Nice shot, whichever way :-)</td>', 'It''s lovely the way the grass fronds are leaning in towards the center to accentuate the triangular nature of the dominant composition. It''s sort of "leading shapes" instead of "leading lines". The touch of mist on the water in the background is a sublime grace note. I''m less enthusiastic about the dominance of the foreground. I understand what you''re after, but there''s a little too much of it IMO. I''d crop up to just under the left end of the near stick, I think, but it''s a tough one. Nice shot, whichever way :-)', '2006-11-01 02:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981577, 418593, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I wish you''d used the skew tool to straighten out the perspective here.</td>', 'This is lovely. I wish you''d used the skew tool to straighten out the perspective here.', '2006-11-01 02:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981587, 418910, 30861, '<td valign="top">If you had processed this so the middle shadows were not so dense (contrast masking, shadow/highlight, or HDRI work) and the swans were more luminous, you''d have close to a winner. Very serene and inviting, the foreground detail is really nice.</td>', 'If you had processed this so the middle shadows were not so dense (contrast masking, shadow/highlight, or HDRI work) and the swans were more luminous, you''d have close to a winner. Very serene and inviting, the foreground detail is really nice.', '2006-11-01 02:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981588, 421087, 30861, '<td valign="top">Helluva cloud formation :-)</td>', 'Helluva cloud formation :-)', '2006-11-01 02:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981592, 419445, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely atmospherics. The use of the skew tool in PS to straighten out the receding verticals of the leftmost trees would have helped this quite a bit IMO.</td>', 'Lovely atmospherics. The use of the skew tool in PS to straighten out the receding verticals of the leftmost trees would have helped this quite a bit IMO.', '2006-11-01 02:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981602, 418971, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this for its stark minimalism. I suspect it will be overlooked, but you have my approval for whatever that''s worth.</td>', 'I like this for its stark minimalism. I suspect it will be overlooked, but you have my approval for whatever that''s worth.', '2006-11-01 02:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981603, 419029, 30861, '<td valign="top">oops... or did you MEAN to enter this horizontally?</td>', 'oops... or did you MEAN to enter this horizontally?', '2006-11-01 02:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
