(2981664, 420650, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow... I wonder if it works better if you desaturate the falls themselves so they glow more? Great capture.</td>', 'Wow... I wonder if it works better if you desaturate the falls themselves so they glow more? Great capture.', '2006-11-01 03:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981667, 421042, 40430, '<td valign="top">More road and trees and less sky might make this already very nice image even stronger.</td>', 'More road and trees and less sky might make this already very nice image even stronger.', '2006-11-01 03:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981670, 418948, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen. You have a problem in that you''ve thrown the sky to magenta but you didn''t pick that up in the reflection, so it''s especially unnatural looking. The very foreground feels too bright to me also, it''s leading my eye down and out. I''d have tossed a gradient on there to contain it and force my eyes into the distance of this remarkable scene.</td>', 'Nicely seen. You have a problem in that you''ve thrown the sky to magenta but you didn''t pick that up in the reflection, so it''s especially unnatural looking. The very foreground feels too bright to me also, it''s leading my eye down and out. I''d have tossed a gradient on there to contain it and force my eyes into the distance of this remarkable scene.', '2006-11-01 03:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981673, 420029, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s sweet :-) I wish it were sharper, though. I suspect you didn''t like the sharpened version because it accentuated the noise in the sky. Neat Image would have been your friend here to get the best of both worlds.</td>', 'That''s sweet :-) I wish it were sharper, though. I suspect you didn''t like the sharpened version because it accentuated the noise in the sky. Neat Image would have been your friend here to get the best of both worlds.', '2006-11-01 03:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981676, 420831, 30861, '<td valign="top">Man, this is CRYING out to be rotated counterclockwise to get that tower standing straight :-( Very dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Man, this is CRYING out to be rotated counterclockwise to get that tower standing straight :-( Very dramatic lighting.', '2006-11-01 03:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
