(2981716, 419948, 25095, '<td valign="top">I bet you''ll really be angry and "grrr"ing when you notice this is in the wrong challenge.  Don''t worry, you weren''t the only one.<br/> <br/>Seems a little bright on the lighting, might want to try a curves adjustment and see what it does.  Also seems a little blurry, not sure if that was part of the "get that camera out of my face" look you were going for.  The eyes really pull you in since they have the most color (well other than the pants on the person behind him.)</td>', 'I bet you''ll really be angry and "grrr"ing when you notice this is in the wrong challenge.  Don''t worry, you weren''t the only one. Seems a little bright on the lighting, might want to try a curves adjustment and see what it does.  Also seems a little blurry, not sure if that was part of the "get that camera out of my face" look you were going for.  The eyes really pull you in since they have the most color (well other than the pants on the person behind him.)', '2006-11-01 03:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
