(2981722, 420178, 30861, '<td valign="top">wow... very powerful. To pick nits, I wish you''d moved a foot to the left and centered the near tree in the open space behind...</td>', 'wow... very powerful. To pick nits, I wish you''d moved a foot to the left and centered the near tree in the open space behind...', '2006-11-01 03:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981725, 419459, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish this weren''t QUITE so dark on the left. I don''t like losing the tree against the sky. Very strong image.</td>', 'I wish this weren''t QUITE so dark on the left. I don''t like losing the tree against the sky. Very strong image.', '2006-11-01 03:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981726, 419131, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK - lets look at the composition ...<br/>horizon, bang in the centre splits the image into 2 equal halves. Would have been better either 1/3 or 2/3 up the image.<br/>Sun on the 3rd line (vertical) good postioning<br/>Foreground interest - lost in the shadows and therefore not really effective.<br/> <br/>now lets look at the exposure - the sun has fooled the camera and you have exposed for the bright sun. You can use a neutral density graduated filter to attempt to equalise the exposre between the sky and the foreground.<br/> <br/>hope this helps a little</td>', 'OK - lets look at the composition ...horizon, bang in the centre splits the image into 2 equal halves. Would have been better either 1/3 or 2/3 up the image.Sun on the 3rd line (vertical) good postioningForeground interest - lost in the shadows and therefore not really effective. now lets look at the exposure - the sun has fooled the camera and you have exposed for the bright sun. You can use a neutral density graduated filter to attempt to equalise the exposre between the sky and the foreground. hope this helps a little', '2006-11-01 03:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981729, 417083, 5354, '<td valign="top">Size matters - go read the tutorial about resizing for DPC</td>', 'Size matters - go read the tutorial about resizing for DPC', '2006-11-01 03:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981730, 419847, 30861, '<td valign="top">Have you noticed the reflection lower right looks like a face? Eerie... Nice shot, perhaps a little too symmetrical top to bottom. The implied horizon is smack-dead-center, and in this case it seems to make the image a little more static than it ought to be. Great POV.</td>', 'Have you noticed the reflection lower right looks like a face? Eerie... Nice shot, perhaps a little too symmetrical top to bottom. The implied horizon is smack-dead-center, and in this case it seems to make the image a little more static than it ought to be. Great POV.', '2006-11-01 03:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981732, 420893, 30861, '<td valign="top">Love the light, don''t care for the shadow myself.</td>', 'Love the light, don''t care for the shadow myself.', '2006-11-01 03:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
