(2981749, 418378, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is terrific, lovely &amp; muted &amp; somber. The lone figure, of course, is the grace note that makes the image. His posture is perfect for the scene, as if a world of cares is weighing on him.</td>', 'This is terrific, lovely & muted & somber. The lone figure, of course, is the grace note that makes the image. His posture is perfect for the scene, as if a world of cares is weighing on him.', '2006-11-01 03:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
