(2981752, 418280, 5354, '<td valign="top">Horizons on the halfway mark are difficult to get away with. Choose a really strong foreground object (rock, tussock of grass, tree stump) then move the horizon up to 2/3. OR if the sky is really powerful then move the horizon down to 1/3</td>', 'Horizons on the halfway mark are difficult to get away with. Choose a really strong foreground object (rock, tussock of grass, tree stump) then move the horizon up to 2/3. OR if the sky is really powerful then move the horizon down to 1/3', '2006-11-01 03:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
