(2981828, 420491, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK - so you shot this from inside a moving train or bus? - the reflections, the dirt in the sky and the general unsharpness of the image do not help this image. Also see the tutorial about resizing for DPC</td>', 'OK - so you shot this from inside a moving train or bus? - the reflections, the dirt in the sky and the general unsharpness of the image do not help this image. Also see the tutorial about resizing for DPC', '2006-11-01 03:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981835, 420499, 5354, '<td valign="top">I like this, maybe I would angle the camera down just a little more, to break the rule of thirds. This image has a strong foreground element which would allow you to make better use and to lose a little of the sky. The interest is in the foreground/midground, make best use of it.</td>', 'I like this, maybe I would angle the camera down just a little more, to break the rule of thirds. This image has a strong foreground element which would allow you to make better use and to lose a little of the sky. The interest is in the foreground/midground, make best use of it.', '2006-11-01 03:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981839, 419816, 58567, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking and well constructed</td>', 'Breathtaking and well constructed', '2006-11-01 03:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981840, 421042, 5354, '<td valign="top">I feel this composition is one which has stuck to the rule of thirds and might have been better in this instance to break thgat rule. Less sky, more road in order to make the best of that strong sweep of tarmac and the yellow stripe. The sky doesn''t really contribute so much</td>', 'I feel this composition is one which has stuck to the rule of thirds and might have been better in this instance to break thgat rule. Less sky, more road in order to make the best of that strong sweep of tarmac and the yellow stripe. The sky doesn''t really contribute so much', '2006-11-01 03:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981842, 418922, 5354, '<td valign="top">Highlights have blown out. These are really difficult shots to do well.</td>', 'Highlights have blown out. These are really difficult shots to do well.', '2006-11-01 03:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981843, 420720, 58567, '<td valign="top">Sits nicely, geometrically...clever processing</td>', 'Sits nicely, geometrically...clever processing', '2006-11-01 03:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981844, 420844, 5354, '<td valign="top">Magical, you already know this is a good landscape so I''m not going to insult you by pointing out the classic elements. You just too good for that ;-)</td>', 'Magical, you already know this is a good landscape so I''m not going to insult you by pointing out the classic elements. You just too good for that ;-)', '2006-11-01 03:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981846, 417946, 58567, '<td valign="top">I like this...extra points for the title and concept</td>', 'I like this...extra points for the title and concept', '2006-11-01 03:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981848, 420005, 58567, '<td valign="top">I see what you mean...beautifully autumnal and well expressed</td>', 'I see what you mean...beautifully autumnal and well expressed', '2006-11-01 03:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981850, 420964, 58567, '<td valign="top">Very nicely worked...good composition and desaturation</td>', 'Very nicely worked...good composition and desaturation', '2006-11-01 03:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981852, 419268, 33352, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is the web size you wish to use, if you have photoshop you can file save to web, set to 640 pixels on the long side of your image, and reduce or increase your kb to 150 or below, this will give the voter a beter vista of your entry....7</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is the web size you wish to use, if you have photoshop you can file save to web, set to 640 pixels on the long side of your image, and reduce or increase your kb to 150 or below, this will give the voter a beter vista of your entry....7', '2006-11-01 03:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981853, 420653, 5354, '<td valign="top">ou have very cleverly waited for the correct time to press the shutter in order to get the person in exactly the right place for the eye to come to rest on her/him. The trouble is the focus makes it uncomfortable to rest there. A deeper depth of field would have made this much much better</td>', 'ou have very cleverly waited for the correct time to press the shutter in order to get the person in exactly the right place for the eye to come to rest on her/him. The trouble is the focus makes it uncomfortable to rest there. A deeper depth of field would have made this much much better', '2006-11-01 03:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981855, 420407, 58567, '<td valign="top">Wow!...every photograher''s dream...nicely exposed</td>', 'Wow!...every photograher''s dream...nicely exposed', '2006-11-01 03:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981856, 420915, 5354, '<td valign="top">You have exposed for the sky here, which has put the main interest into the dark. Try a neutral density graduated filter to even out the differences between sky and foreground</td>', 'You have exposed for the sky here, which has put the main interest into the dark. Try a neutral density graduated filter to even out the differences between sky and foreground', '2006-11-01 03:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981858, 420399, 5354, '<td valign="top">Great use of the stump and the dramatic sky</td>', 'Great use of the stump and the dramatic sky', '2006-11-01 04:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981861, 418064, 58567, '<td valign="top">Beautifully constructed shot...the use of those subtle colours and contrasts is very good.....my top mark tonight!</td>', 'Beautifully constructed shot...the use of those subtle colours and contrasts is very good.....my top mark tonight!', '2006-11-01 04:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981863, 418847, 58567, '<td valign="top">Worth the climb to get such a gritty shot...nicely done!</td>', 'Worth the climb to get such a gritty shot...nicely done!', '2006-11-01 04:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981867, 418838, 58567, '<td valign="top">The pun gets a point more...nicely done</td>', 'The pun gets a point more...nicely done', '2006-11-01 04:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981873, 420757, 58567, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot...understated and beautiful</td>', 'I like this a lot...understated and beautiful', '2006-11-01 04:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2981877, 420869, 58567, '<td valign="top">Moody and good in sepia</td>', 'Moody and good in sepia', '2006-11-01 04:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
