(2982054, 418471, 41337, '<td valign="top">Funky good.</td>', 'Funky good.', '2006-11-01 05:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982067, 420697, 5354, '<td valign="top">Untitled - just about says it all. Probably best to put this one in a locked drawer out of sight ;-)<br/> <br/>Sorry its got nothing to recommend it as a photograph. The shadows are lacking any detail, the sky is bland, there is nothing which can be described as a main focal point.  Just DULL unfortunately.</td>', 'Untitled - just about says it all. Probably best to put this one in a locked drawer out of sight ;-) Sorry its got nothing to recommend it as a photograph. The shadows are lacking any detail, the sky is bland, there is nothing which can be described as a main focal point.  Just DULL unfortunately.', '2006-11-01 05:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
