(2982092, 419496, 20608, '<td valign="top">This would be better in the other challenge LOL.. sorry for joking but you must be GUTTED you put it in the wrong one.. nearly did it myself once but my son spotted it and i had time to swap it over.. too much work and not enough play.. hope they dont kill you on the score. I gave you a 10 to help out a bit</td>', 'This would be better in the other challenge LOL.. sorry for joking but you must be GUTTED you put it in the wrong one.. nearly did it myself once but my son spotted it and i had time to swap it over.. too much work and not enough play.. hope they dont kill you on the score. I gave you a 10 to help out a bit', '2006-11-01 05:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982096, 420935, 5354, '<td valign="top">I think you just over-exposed this a little. The colours feels washed out and there appears to be a slight haze over the image. Maybe rectify this with a nudge of the contrast slider.</td>', 'I think you just over-exposed this a little. The colours feels washed out and there appears to be a slight haze over the image. Maybe rectify this with a nudge of the contrast slider.', '2006-11-01 05:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982099, 420702, 5354, '<td valign="top">Never did like photos from airplanes, this one doesn''t make me change my mind</td>', 'Never did like photos from airplanes, this one doesn''t make me change my mind', '2006-11-01 05:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982103, 417545, 5354, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing the wrong challenge</td>', 'I''m guessing the wrong challenge', '2006-11-01 05:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982108, 418699, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice try to keep that bland white sky out of the image. The light just isn''t working for you though. This is the sort of image I would take as a riminder to go back and shoot when conditions are good. There is potential here, but on another day.</td>', 'Nice try to keep that bland white sky out of the image. The light just isn''t working for you though. This is the sort of image I would take as a riminder to go back and shoot when conditions are good. There is potential here, but on another day.', '2006-11-01 05:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982119, 419702, 5354, '<td valign="top">Now I don''t think many voters will stop to look at this. It doesn''t hit the viewer in the face, but I think its wonderfully subtle. The colours in the foreground are beautiful, maybe the midground and the water lets it down slightly. There is definitely some potential in this location, maybe one to go back a few times until conditions are better.</td>', 'Now I don''t think many voters will stop to look at this. It doesn''t hit the viewer in the face, but I think its wonderfully subtle. The colours in the foreground are beautiful, maybe the midground and the water lets it down slightly. There is definitely some potential in this location, maybe one to go back a few times until conditions are better.', '2006-11-01 05:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982125, 421005, 5354, '<td valign="top">Terrific, that road is just a wonderful lead in. Maybe the sky could have been a little more powerful, but then you have to take whats on offer. This would be in my book of favourite locations and deserves a few more visits to capture the very best this location has to offer.</td>', 'Terrific, that road is just a wonderful lead in. Maybe the sky could have been a little more powerful, but then you have to take whats on offer. This would be in my book of favourite locations and deserves a few more visits to capture the very best this location has to offer.', '2006-11-01 05:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982145, 417445, 5354, '<td valign="top">See the tutorial about resizing for DPC<br/>The challenge was to take a landscape in portrait (vertical) orientation. This image doesn''t meet the criteria.</td>', 'See the tutorial about resizing for DPCThe challenge was to take a landscape in portrait (vertical) orientation. This image doesn''t meet the criteria.', '2006-11-01 05:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982150, 417911, 5354, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the post processing at all. I''m sure some will love it.</td>', 'Not keen on the post processing at all. I''m sure some will love it.', '2006-11-01 05:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982158, 418065, 5354, '<td valign="top">The horizon is almost (not quite) bang in the middle of the image. This is a difficult composition to pull off, it breaks the rule of thirds. It is possible to break the rule, but the image has to be very strong in order to do that. This image is not strong enough to attempt this. Try and find a stream, a rock a tree stump, a big clump of heather to provide you with a foreground, then move the horizon upto 2/3. This landscape deserves it, its beautiful</td>', 'The horizon is almost (not quite) bang in the middle of the image. This is a difficult composition to pull off, it breaks the rule of thirds. It is possible to break the rule, but the image has to be very strong in order to do that. This image is not strong enough to attempt this. Try and find a stream, a rock a tree stump, a big clump of heather to provide you with a foreground, then move the horizon upto 2/3. This landscape deserves it, its beautiful', '2006-11-01 05:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982166, 419790, 5354, '<td valign="top">So where''s the landscape orientation?<br/>I like the image its very very strong, but it just doesn''t fit the challenge this time round. Rotate the camera o crop to a portrait and I''d give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'So where''s the landscape orientation?I like the image its very very strong, but it just doesn''t fit the challenge this time round. Rotate the camera o crop to a portrait and I''d give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2006-11-01 05:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982171, 420172, 5354, '<td valign="top">I''m having difficulty working this out. What the hell is that blue?<br/>Feels like two images badly layered in photoshop</td>', 'I''m having difficulty working this out. What the hell is that blue?Feels like two images badly layered in photoshop', '2006-11-01 06:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982173, 417720, 40126, '<td valign="top">perfect vertical framing for those tall pines. nice colors too. 9</td>', 'perfect vertical framing for those tall pines. nice colors too. 9', '2006-11-01 06:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982175, 419041, 42171, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. The vast negative space of the sky seems to work well and add to a feeling of isolation! Is it infra red or is that snow?</td>', 'I really like this image. The vast negative space of the sky seems to work well and add to a feeling of isolation! Is it infra red or is that snow?', '2006-11-01 06:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982176, 420757, 5354, '<td valign="top">Ahhh - even before I read the title I knew where this was taken ;-)<br/>That bush intruding on the left needs to be in or out, not just glancing round the corner. The stronger image might have been to use the towers up at the Derwent dam in order to have some structure to the composition.</td>', 'Ahhh - even before I read the title I knew where this was taken ;-)That bush intruding on the left needs to be in or out, not just glancing round the corner. The stronger image might have been to use the towers up at the Derwent dam in order to have some structure to the composition.', '2006-11-01 06:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982178, 419453, 5354, '<td valign="top">See the tutorial about resizing for DPC</td>', 'See the tutorial about resizing for DPC', '2006-11-01 06:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982179, 421148, 5354, '<td valign="top">Too surreal for me</td>', 'Too surreal for me', '2006-11-01 06:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2982182, 420185, 5354, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you entered the wrong challenge</td>', 'I''m guessing you entered the wrong challenge', '2006-11-01 06:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
