(2982873, 420499, 67152, '<td valign="top">The view is amazing and the colors are nice.  However, the image does not have enough contrast and the foreground is too dark.</td>', 'The view is amazing and the colors are nice.  However, the image does not have enough contrast and the foreground is too dark.', '2006-11-01 09:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
