(2983572, 419095, 30508, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I recall posting in a recent thread how I thought this location was made for this challenge.  Nice job!  I don''t think I''ve ever seen that much water in the pool at the bottom of the falls.  I''m curious as to who''s this is.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge to find out.  My only criticism is that I wish the colors were a bit brighter.</td>', 'Hmmm, I recall posting in a recent thread how I thought this location was made for this challenge.  Nice job!  I don''t think I''ve ever seen that much water in the pool at the bottom of the falls.  I''m curious as to who''s this is.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge to find out.  My only criticism is that I wish the colors were a bit brighter.', '2006-11-01 11:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983587, 419054, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines.  Nice colors as well.  Too bad the clouds are just a little blown out.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines.  Nice colors as well.  Too bad the clouds are just a little blown out.', '2006-11-01 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
