(2983772, 418294, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - mood, lighting, and colors. The large area of blank white in the upper right detracts from the rest of the scene.</td>', 'Lovely shot - mood, lighting, and colors. The large area of blank white in the upper right detracts from the rest of the scene.', '2006-11-01 11:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983776, 420803, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract landscape.  I really like the framing by the logs and the rock at the bottom.</td>', 'Interesting abstract landscape.  I really like the framing by the logs and the rock at the bottom.', '2006-11-01 11:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983778, 420126, 29293, '<td valign="top">looks square to me</td>', 'looks square to me', '2006-11-01 11:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983780, 419802, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm colors for a cold evening.</td>', 'Beautiful warm colors for a cold evening.', '2006-11-01 11:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983787, 419937, 29293, '<td valign="top">great title</td>', 'great title', '2006-11-01 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983790, 417946, 67723, '<td valign="top">the leaf in front is distracting because it is out of focus</td>', 'the leaf in front is distracting because it is out of focus', '2006-11-01 11:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983791, 417545, 66384, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like a landscape to me. I''m not voting on this one.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like a landscape to me. I''m not voting on this one.', '2006-11-01 11:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983803, 420648, 67723, '<td valign="top">landscape not cityscape  Excellent photo otherwise</td>', 'landscape not cityscape  Excellent photo otherwise', '2006-11-01 11:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983810, 417202, 66106, '<td valign="top">i was amazed of this photograph! in could have deen an artistic paint. i would give you 10 if it a little more net and if the yellow line on the right bottom of the photo wouldn''t exist.</td>', 'i was amazed of this photograph! in could have deen an artistic paint. i would give you 10 if it a little more net and if the yellow line on the right bottom of the photo wouldn''t exist.', '2006-11-01 11:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983815, 420844, 67723, '<td valign="top">NICE!!!!  it moves me ...9</td>', 'NICE!!!!  it moves me ...9', '2006-11-01 11:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983820, 420185, 67723, '<td valign="top">landscape?????   wront orientation too</td>', 'landscape?????   wront orientation too', '2006-11-01 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983823, 420491, 31829, '<td valign="top">The reflection really hurts this image.</td>', 'The reflection really hurts this image.', '2006-11-01 11:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983824, 420697, 67723, '<td valign="top">aww power lines kind of wreck it</td>', 'aww power lines kind of wreck it', '2006-11-01 11:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983826, 420850, 66384, '<td valign="top">Since the forground is the most interesting part of this photo, I think it should be in sharp focus. The negative space at the top detracts from the scene.</td>', 'Since the forground is the most interesting part of this photo, I think it should be in sharp focus. The negative space at the top detracts from the scene.', '2006-11-01 11:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983828, 420829, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, but I am not overly keen on the composition; the elements in the water don''t seem to lead my eye in to the scene.</td>', 'Lovely colours, but I am not overly keen on the composition; the elements in the water don''t seem to lead my eye in to the scene.', '2006-11-01 11:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983834, 419496, 67723, '<td valign="top">wrong contest i think</td>', 'wrong contest i think', '2006-11-01 11:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983836, 419289, 66106, '<td valign="top">very nice photograph but the colours are so vivid that they look unreal.</td>', 'very nice photograph but the colours are so vivid that they look unreal.', '2006-11-01 11:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983839, 420214, 31829, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the editing, esp. the sky is not very well done.</td>', 'Sorry but the editing, esp. the sky is not very well done.', '2006-11-01 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983845, 419445, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly interesting and original!  I would guess that you must have used a pretty strong ND grad filter to be able to expose for the trees, but I am confused by the blocky jaggedness of the outline of the nearest trunks.</td>', 'Certainly interesting and original!  I would guess that you must have used a pretty strong ND grad filter to be able to expose for the trees, but I am confused by the blocky jaggedness of the outline of the nearest trunks.', '2006-11-01 11:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983848, 420669, 30508, '<td valign="top">I think this is just a little too contrasty for my tastes.</td>', 'I think this is just a little too contrasty for my tastes.', '2006-11-01 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983849, 420961, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice but too small</td>', 'nice but too small', '2006-11-01 11:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983852, 420185, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait.  I wish you''d gotten it in the correct challenge.  I would probably give it a 7 in that challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait.  I wish you''d gotten it in the correct challenge.  I would probably give it a 7 in that challenge.', '2006-11-01 11:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983854, 419118, 31829, '<td valign="top">Great image, but to me it just doesn''t meet this challenge.</td>', 'Great image, but to me it just doesn''t meet this challenge.', '2006-11-01 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983859, 418659, 30508, '<td valign="top">This looks almot alien.  Not really my cup of tea, but it is certainly interesting.</td>', 'This looks almot alien.  Not really my cup of tea, but it is certainly interesting.', '2006-11-01 11:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983865, 419872, 30508, '<td valign="top">Hay bales and fall foliage -- I love it.  I like the position of the bale in the foreground.  It really helps draw the eye into the frame.</td>', 'Hay bales and fall foliage -- I love it.  I like the position of the bale in the foreground.  It really helps draw the eye into the frame.', '2006-11-01 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983872, 420491, 3102, '<td valign="top">You probably ought to at least get out of the car to take a shot the next time :)</td>', 'You probably ought to at least get out of the car to take a shot the next time :)', '2006-11-01 11:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983877, 420706, 66106, '<td valign="top">i would appreciate this photograph much more if you wouldn''t have made the colours so much vivid.</td>', 'i would appreciate this photograph much more if you wouldn''t have made the colours so much vivid.', '2006-11-01 11:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983892, 420697, 30508, '<td valign="top">There really isn''t much to this shot to get excited about.  The sillhoute of the bush isn''t that compelling and the colors in the sky are rather muted.</td>', 'There really isn''t much to this shot to get excited about.  The sillhoute of the bush isn''t that compelling and the colors in the sky are rather muted.', '2006-11-01 11:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983896, 420032, 30508, '<td valign="top">I like the strong vertical lines of the tree and the colors of the leaves.</td>', 'I like the strong vertical lines of the tree and the colors of the leaves.', '2006-11-01 11:58:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2983900, 418065, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice.  You get a strong sense of depth and distance.</td>', 'Nice.  You get a strong sense of depth and distance.', '2006-11-01 11:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983906, 420564, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Perhaps a little too oversaturated, but that''s arguable.</td>', 'Very nice.  Perhaps a little too oversaturated, but that''s arguable.', '2006-11-01 12:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983912, 421040, 30508, '<td valign="top">I think this gets into a grey area of what is a landscape.  The last thing I want to be is the DNMC police, though, so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  That said, I love the sillouhettes and the beautful sunset.  The cell phone camera is a great point of interest.</td>', 'I think this gets into a grey area of what is a landscape.  The last thing I want to be is the DNMC police, though, so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  That said, I love the sillouhettes and the beautful sunset.  The cell phone camera is a great point of interest.', '2006-11-01 12:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2983918, 421048, 30508, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see this during sunrise or sunset to get some nice shadows amongst the trees.  Without that, it looks a little too flat.</td>', 'I''d love to see this during sunrise or sunset to get some nice shadows amongst the trees.  Without that, it looks a little too flat.', '2006-11-01 12:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984020, 419968, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective :)</td>', 'Nice perspective :)', '2006-11-01 12:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984040, 418992, 66353, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed</td>', 'Very nice indeed', '2006-11-01 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984044, 419235, 32147, '<td valign="top">Interesting Long Exposure.  Not your typical DPC shot - perhaps that is why I like it. :)  Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting Long Exposure.  Not your typical DPC shot - perhaps that is why I like it. :)  Nice job.', '2006-11-01 12:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984048, 420525, 32147, '<td valign="top">nice b/w.</td>', 'nice b/w.', '2006-11-01 12:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984051, 418901, 32147, '<td valign="top">good composition.</td>', 'good composition.', '2006-11-01 12:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984054, 419054, 66353, '<td valign="top">Good leading lines</td>', 'Good leading lines', '2006-11-01 12:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984069, 420893, 32147, '<td valign="top">great color on the trees, but I''d like it better without the shadow.</td>', 'great color on the trees, but I''d like it better without the shadow.', '2006-11-01 12:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984078, 417911, 32147, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to see this without the filter effect on the photo.  perhaps as a high contrast photo or as a high key?  not sure.</td>', 'I''d prefer to see this without the filter effect on the photo.  perhaps as a high contrast photo or as a high key?  not sure.', '2006-11-01 12:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984082, 421103, 32147, '<td valign="top">great colors.  nice photo.</td>', 'great colors.  nice photo.', '2006-11-01 12:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984085, 419790, 20925, '<td valign="top">Very clever take on the challenge.  I hope you do not suffer too many DNMC-type thinkers.</td>', 'Very clever take on the challenge.  I hope you do not suffer too many DNMC-type thinkers.', '2006-11-01 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984089, 420442, 32147, '<td valign="top">cool.  Nice way to capture something a bit differently.  I rather like it.</td>', 'cool.  Nice way to capture something a bit differently.  I rather like it.', '2006-11-01 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984093, 418240, 32147, '<td valign="top">nice bluetime shot.</td>', 'nice bluetime shot.', '2006-11-01 12:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984103, 419524, 32147, '<td valign="top">interesting mix of colors and contrast.  nicely done.</td>', 'interesting mix of colors and contrast.  nicely done.', '2006-11-01 12:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984104, 420194, 52628, '<td valign="top">Great autumn image!</td>', 'Great autumn image!', '2006-11-01 12:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984109, 419525, 30508, '<td valign="top">Intersting shapes and lines.  The sky is outstanding.</td>', 'Intersting shapes and lines.  The sky is outstanding.', '2006-11-01 12:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984112, 418378, 32147, '<td valign="top">very nice photo.  Subtle colors and the haze adds to the overall feel here.  I really liked this shot.</td>', 'very nice photo.  Subtle colors and the haze adds to the overall feel here.  I really liked this shot.', '2006-11-01 12:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984121, 420684, 32147, '<td valign="top">dark and dreary=nice  good exposure and choice of subject.</td>', 'dark and dreary=nice  good exposure and choice of subject.', '2006-11-01 12:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984122, 418067, 52628, '<td valign="top">Lovely, great colors!</td>', 'Lovely, great colors!', '2006-11-01 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984125, 420508, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Could be more compelling with better lighting on the foreground.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Could be more compelling with better lighting on the foreground.', '2006-11-01 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984128, 421048, 32147, '<td valign="top">good colors, but I find myself wishing for more contrast and definition.</td>', 'good colors, but I find myself wishing for more contrast and definition.', '2006-11-01 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984130, 420545, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections and color.  Seems a little soft around the trees though.</td>', 'Nice reflections and color.  Seems a little soft around the trees though.', '2006-11-01 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984138, 417195, 30508, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to figure out what I was looking at.  Very interesting shot.</td>', 'It took me a moment to figure out what I was looking at.  Very interesting shot.', '2006-11-01 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984144, 418064, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very surreal -- wonderful composition.</td>', 'Very surreal -- wonderful composition.', '2006-11-01 12:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984146, 419268, 32147, '<td valign="top">not a bad photo and its a good capture of fall/autumn colors.  However, I wish that you had given us a larger photo to look at.</td>', 'not a bad photo and its a good capture of fall/autumn colors.  However, I wish that you had given us a larger photo to look at.', '2006-11-01 12:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984151, 418064, 32147, '<td valign="top">great infared shot.  I love the title as well. 8</td>', 'great infared shot.  I love the title as well. 8', '2006-11-01 12:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984157, 420706, 52628, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Great use of colors and composition.</td>', 'Funny!  Great use of colors and composition.', '2006-11-01 12:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984161, 419989, 32147, '<td valign="top">curious - what is the bubble like object in the upper left?  Is that the moon?</td>', 'curious - what is the bubble like object in the upper left?  Is that the moon?', '2006-11-01 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984172, 418382, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is very peaceful.  The foreground adds a nice sense of distance, but lacks anything visual interesting to focus on.</td>', 'This is very peaceful.  The foreground adds a nice sense of distance, but lacks anything visual interesting to focus on.', '2006-11-01 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984176, 417933, 32147, '<td valign="top">good title for a short DoF shot.  I like shallow dof and shoot that style myself quite a bit.  I just wish there was a bit more definition and/or contrast here.  I find it looking like an old film photograph.  If that is your intention, then great, but otherwise, I fear you''ll lose points for it.</td>', 'good title for a short DoF shot.  I like shallow dof and shoot that style myself quite a bit.  I just wish there was a bit more definition and/or contrast here.  I find it looking like an old film photograph.  If that is your intention, then great, but otherwise, I fear you''ll lose points for it.', '2006-11-01 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984183, 418750, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  The light on the buildings is a little too hard for my tastes though.  Also, it feels like it tilts slightly to the left.</td>', 'Nice sky.  The light on the buildings is a little too hard for my tastes though.  Also, it feels like it tilts slightly to the left.', '2006-11-01 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984190, 420190, 32147, '<td valign="top">good choice for b/w.  I find myself wondering what happened to the left side of that tree!  Forest fire? Volcano? Interesting.</td>', 'good choice for b/w.  I find myself wondering what happened to the left side of that tree!  Forest fire? Volcano? Interesting.', '2006-11-01 12:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984191, 419948, 30508, '<td valign="top">Looks like this should have been in the portraits challenge.  I would have probably only given this a five.  You''ve captured a good moment, but too much of the face is out of focus (including the eyes).</td>', 'Looks like this should have been in the portraits challenge.  I would have probably only given this a five.  You''ve captured a good moment, but too much of the face is out of focus (including the eyes).', '2006-11-01 12:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984195, 419383, 32147, '<td valign="top">fish! great color.</td>', 'fish! great color.', '2006-11-01 12:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984200, 420575, 30508, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel like the top half of the image really adds much to this.  Furthermore, having the buildings cut off as they are feels awkward.</td>', 'I don''t feel like the top half of the image really adds much to this.  Furthermore, having the buildings cut off as they are feels awkward.', '2006-11-01 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984204, 419294, 32147, '<td valign="top">good color and nice composition.  However, the grain and focus is problematic.</td>', 'good color and nice composition.  However, the grain and focus is problematic.', '2006-11-01 12:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984206, 420568, 32147, '<td valign="top">great shot! 8</td>', 'great shot! 8', '2006-11-01 12:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984211, 419474, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and sunset.  This really could''ve have been great if you could have made better use of the path.  As it is it kind of draws they eye out of the frame instead of leading it inward.  Still a good shot though.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and sunset.  This really could''ve have been great if you could have made better use of the path.  As it is it kind of draws they eye out of the frame instead of leading it inward.  Still a good shot though.', '2006-11-01 12:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984216, 418699, 51538, '<td valign="top">Touch the style, and you wont get married - or is that the Kissing Gate.  Thanks for the reminder of home.  I like the pastoral view over the Green and Pleasant Land.</td>', 'Touch the style, and you wont get married - or is that the Kissing Gate.  Thanks for the reminder of home.  I like the pastoral view over the Green and Pleasant Land.', '2006-11-01 12:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984220, 418778, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, reflections and blurred water.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, reflections and blurred water.', '2006-11-01 12:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984226, 419203, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Looks a little oversharpened though.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Looks a little oversharpened though.', '2006-11-01 12:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984246, 421096, 50357, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and reflection.  10</td>', 'Beautiful colors and reflection.  10', '2006-11-01 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984253, 420499, 50357, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful!  10</td>', 'Really beautiful!  10', '2006-11-01 12:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984256, 419989, 30608, '<td valign="top">Love the beautiful Autumn colors. Looks like a peaceful place to watch the moon rise.</td>', 'Love the beautiful Autumn colors. Looks like a peaceful place to watch the moon rise.', '2006-11-01 12:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984257, 419289, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great colors and reflections.  Perhaps a bit too saturated for my tastes though.</td>', 'Great colors and reflections.  Perhaps a bit too saturated for my tastes though.', '2006-11-01 12:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2984264, 418797, 32147, '<td valign="top">I think this could be an interesting subject for a photo, but as it is composed, I dont find it all that interesting.  Perhaps there is nothing specific to direct the viewers attention to.</td>', 'I think this could be an interesting subject for a photo, but as it is composed, I dont find it all that interesting.  Perhaps there is nothing specific to direct the viewers attention to.', '2006-11-01 12:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
