(2985257, 421134, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  The snow looks a little grey, though.  Might have more pop is if were brighter.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  The snow looks a little grey, though.  Might have more pop is if were brighter.', '2006-11-01 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985259, 420649, 64175, '<td valign="top">The reddish tint takes away from the bottom half of the photo.  Playing with the saturation settings or the RGB values through one of the other options such as a channel mixer would probably help.  5.</td>', 'The reddish tint takes away from the bottom half of the photo.  Playing with the saturation settings or the RGB values through one of the other options such as a channel mixer would probably help.  5.', '2006-11-01 15:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985262, 418678, 30508, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely!</td>', 'Simply lovely!', '2006-11-01 15:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985266, 421016, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I love the reflections in the water.</td>', 'Nice.  I love the reflections in the water.', '2006-11-01 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985269, 418294, 30508, '<td valign="top">Lovely with the mist rising off the water and the great colors of the leaves.  I wish the sky weren''t so blown out, though.</td>', 'Lovely with the mist rising off the water and the great colors of the leaves.  I wish the sky weren''t so blown out, though.', '2006-11-01 15:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985277, 420180, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very well executed.  Very strong composition.</td>', 'Very well executed.  Very strong composition.', '2006-11-01 15:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985280, 418992, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic use of light and colors.</td>', 'Very dramatic use of light and colors.', '2006-11-01 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985286, 418901, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  I love the colors and curves.  I wish the foreground was more attractive though.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  I love the colors and curves.  I wish the foreground was more attractive though.', '2006-11-01 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985287, 419872, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but think it may have been improved if the crop did not quarter the front hay bale. 6.</td>', 'I like the composition but think it may have been improved if the crop did not quarter the front hay bale. 6.', '2006-11-01 15:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985293, 417911, 30508, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, but not really my cup of tea.  I also don''t think this qualifies as a landscape, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Dramatic, but not really my cup of tea.  I also don''t think this qualifies as a landscape, but that''s just me.', '2006-11-01 15:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985303, 420844, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting and great ocean blur.  Sky looks just a tad oversaturated near the sun, though.</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting and great ocean blur.  Sky looks just a tad oversaturated near the sun, though.', '2006-11-01 15:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985306, 419968, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like the line of trees in the composition.  The white around the border is a little distracting but I don''t really take off points for borders.  I do not like the leaning effect caused by the angle of the shot. I think it would be a nicer shot, IMO, if the image had been rotated to the horizontal point of view. 5.</td>', 'I like the line of trees in the composition.  The white around the border is a little distracting but I don''t really take off points for borders.  I do not like the leaning effect caused by the angle of the shot. I think it would be a nicer shot, IMO, if the image had been rotated to the horizontal point of view. 5.', '2006-11-01 15:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2985309, 417445, 31829, '<td valign="top">Eh???  Did we forget the challenge??? ;-)</td>', 'Eh???  Did we forget the challenge??? ;-)', '2006-11-01 15:56:57.000000', NULL, 1);
