(2985365, 420853, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp details and well exposed.  This would really benefit from more dramatic lighting, but you can only do so much.</td>', 'Nice sharp details and well exposed.  This would really benefit from more dramatic lighting, but you can only do so much.', '2006-11-01 16:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
