(2986280, 420413, 64933, '<td valign="top">I realy like this picture and how the grass sort of matches the pointed shape of the hills reflection. It would have made it a little better if you cropped out a bit of bottom, even though I think  it is interesting how you see the leaves under the water- it just kind of distracts from the other points of interest and horizon.</td>', 'I realy like this picture and how the grass sort of matches the pointed shape of the hills reflection. It would have made it a little better if you cropped out a bit of bottom, even though I think  it is interesting how you see the leaves under the water- it just kind of distracts from the other points of interest and horizon.', '2006-11-01 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
