(2986291, 420444, 40386, '<td valign="top">If this is Victoria Falls in Zimbabwe I am trying to decide where this was shot from?  If it was on the side where Livingstons statue is then boy has the rock changed (eroded) since I last saw it!  I remember this falls when there were only about three trickles running over the whole falls area because of a 9 year drought.  Good luck lovely picture,</td>', 'If this is Victoria Falls in Zimbabwe I am trying to decide where this was shot from?  If it was on the side where Livingstons statue is then boy has the rock changed (eroded) since I last saw it!  I remember this falls when there were only about three trickles running over the whole falls area because of a 9 year drought.  Good luck lovely picture,', '2006-11-01 19:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
