(2988362, 421140, 67941, '<td valign="top">too warm</td>', 'too warm', '2006-11-02 08:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988372, 420564, 49109, '<td valign="top">sorry, that''s a bit too much saturation and contrast, hurts my eyes</td>', 'sorry, that''s a bit too much saturation and contrast, hurts my eyes', '2006-11-02 08:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988378, 417350, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love the image but not 100% sold on the border.  9</td>', 'Love the image but not 100% sold on the border.  9', '2006-11-02 08:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988381, 419336, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful scene.  Personally I''d crop a little more off the bottom.</td>', 'Very peaceful scene.  Personally I''d crop a little more off the bottom.', '2006-11-02 08:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988384, 420063, 35947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene!  IMHO this would be better in a landscape orientation simple to catch more of the water and less of the sky which is a little boring. Can''t wait to see the out takes!  9</td>', 'Beautiful scene!  IMHO this would be better in a landscape orientation simple to catch more of the water and less of the sky which is a little boring. Can''t wait to see the out takes!  9', '2006-11-02 08:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988386, 420491, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed scene.  I''d like to see it a little larger and without the window refections.</td>', 'Nicely composed scene.  I''d like to see it a little larger and without the window refections.', '2006-11-02 08:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988388, 418910, 49109, '<td valign="top">excellent composition and color, almost like a painting. trees in the background are a bit oversharpened, though -8</td>', 'excellent composition and color, almost like a painting. trees in the background are a bit oversharpened, though -8', '2006-11-02 08:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988394, 420964, 35947, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful!  Can''t think of a thing that would improve this image in any way, except for a simple clean border ;)  10</td>', 'Simply beautiful!  Can''t think of a thing that would improve this image in any way, except for a simple clean border ;)  10', '2006-11-02 08:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988396, 418310, 62330, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this piece as it draws the eye upwards through the water falls.  the portrait format works better here than if it were landscape format.</td>', 'I like the composition of this piece as it draws the eye upwards through the water falls.  the portrait format works better here than if it were landscape format.', '2006-11-02 08:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988399, 420442, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image, don''t care much for the fence but not much you can do about it for the challenge.  IMHO would make a great print once the fence is cleaned out.</td>', 'Very pretty image, don''t care much for the fence but not much you can do about it for the challenge.  IMHO would make a great print once the fence is cleaned out.', '2006-11-02 08:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988401, 419326, 49109, '<td valign="top">way too dark</td>', 'way too dark', '2006-11-02 08:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988403, 418904, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love how you went OOTB and shot at an angle!</td>', 'Love how you went OOTB and shot at an angle!', '2006-11-02 08:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988405, 417345, 62330, '<td valign="top">this works in portrait format, but also could just as well have been done in landscape</td>', 'this works in portrait format, but also could just as well have been done in landscape', '2006-11-02 08:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988411, 420404, 35947, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get a good look when the image is so small.  Check the tutorials for help on you next submition.</td>', 'It''s hard to get a good look when the image is so small.  Check the tutorials for help on you next submition.', '2006-11-02 08:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988412, 418064, 14735, '<td valign="top">I think the infrared was a very nice choice here.</td>', 'I think the infrared was a very nice choice here.', '2006-11-02 08:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988417, 420813, 49109, '<td valign="top">upper half osf sky, moon and stars look somehow artificial, as if they were painted or taken from another photo... voting as if not</td>', 'upper half osf sky, moon and stars look somehow artificial, as if they were painted or taken from another photo... voting as if not', '2006-11-02 08:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988420, 417545, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done portrait, but a poor choice for the challenge IMHO.</td>', 'Wonderfully done portrait, but a poor choice for the challenge IMHO.', '2006-11-02 08:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988422, 420185, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cute candid!  Too bad wrong challenge!</td>', 'Very cute candid!  Too bad wrong challenge!', '2006-11-02 08:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988426, 420844, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Only thought that comes to mind!</td>', 'Wow!  Only thought that comes to mind!', '2006-11-02 08:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988430, 419790, 49109, '<td valign="top">err, "landscape in portrait orientation" means, that the width of the photo is smaller than its height; this is "landscape in landscape orientation". Still, it is a nice idea well executed.</td>', 'err, "landscape in portrait orientation" means, that the width of the photo is smaller than its height; this is "landscape in landscape orientation". Still, it is a nice idea well executed.', '2006-11-02 08:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988433, 419966, 49109, '<td valign="top">where''s the land from "landscape"?</td>', 'where''s the land from "landscape"?', '2006-11-02 08:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988436, 419702, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground images and the island in the back adds a good break between the sea and sky.</td>', 'I like the foreground images and the island in the back adds a good break between the sea and sky.', '2006-11-02 08:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988442, 420855, 14735, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice exposure. Like the colors of the trees and the reflection in the water.</td>', 'Looks like a nice exposure. Like the colors of the trees and the reflection in the water.', '2006-11-02 08:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988445, 420893, 14735, '<td valign="top">Not sure I cared for the shadow.</td>', 'Not sure I cared for the shadow.', '2006-11-02 09:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988451, 421107, 14735, '<td valign="top">For me the angle should have been up a bit more to show the nice colors and shape of the tree</td>', 'For me the angle should have been up a bit more to show the nice colors and shape of the tree', '2006-11-02 09:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988472, 420215, 14735, '<td valign="top">The foreground is a bit dark IMO.</td>', 'The foreground is a bit dark IMO.', '2006-11-02 09:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988483, 418992, 32581, '<td valign="top">Like it. Where are those shadows from?</td>', 'Like it. Where are those shadows from?', '2006-11-02 09:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988486, 419942, 32581, '<td valign="top">nice composition and balance. I wish the lighting was even.</td>', 'nice composition and balance. I wish the lighting was even.', '2006-11-02 09:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988492, 420194, 32581, '<td valign="top">wow! nice one.For me the Upper right is little over exposed.</td>', 'wow! nice one.For me the Upper right is little over exposed.', '2006-11-02 09:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988499, 420684, 32581, '<td valign="top">Like the compisition 6 for that. For me the reflection of lights on those walls are little disturbing. But that''s when balanced. Good luck.</td>', 'Like the compisition 6 for that. For me the reflection of lights on those walls are little disturbing. But that''s when balanced. Good luck.', '2006-11-02 09:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988501, 417946, 32581, '<td valign="top">Idea is good. Try this again with better focus and DOF.</td>', 'Idea is good. Try this again with better focus and DOF.', '2006-11-02 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988502, 420126, 32581, '<td valign="top">nice one.</td>', 'nice one.', '2006-11-02 09:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988503, 418471, 32581, '<td valign="top">wonderful image.</td>', 'wonderful image.', '2006-11-02 09:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988506, 420844, 32581, '<td valign="top">good one.</td>', 'good one.', '2006-11-02 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988508, 417350, 32581, '<td valign="top">that''s a fantastic idea</td>', 'that''s a fantastic idea', '2006-11-02 09:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988516, 421039, 32581, '<td valign="top">nice execution.</td>', 'nice execution.', '2006-11-02 09:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988520, 417471, 32581, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. I wish the background was also much ''greener''.</td>', 'This is wonderful. I wish the background was also much ''greener''.', '2006-11-02 09:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988552, 420178, 26001, '<td valign="top">looks like directly out from some horror movie. almost "film negative" like feel to it. i like it.</td>', 'looks like directly out from some horror movie. almost "film negative" like feel to it. i like it.', '2006-11-02 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988554, 418904, 26001, '<td valign="top">interesting orientation. might not be very popular but i like it nonetheless.</td>', 'interesting orientation. might not be very popular but i like it nonetheless.', '2006-11-02 09:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988559, 420970, 26001, '<td valign="top">Lot of yellow on the left distract my eye from the main subject, bridge, here. I am sure a little crop would help. it wouldnt change my vote though. i like this.</td>', 'Lot of yellow on the left distract my eye from the main subject, bridge, here. I am sure a little crop would help. it wouldnt change my vote though. i like this.', '2006-11-02 09:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988575, 421039, 26001, '<td valign="top">A perfect one!!!</td>', 'A perfect one!!!', '2006-11-02 09:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988578, 420645, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice, rich colors and an interesting scene.  I like the post in the foreground, but what is really cool about this shot is the contrail pointing straight at the moon.  Nice catch.</td>', 'Nice, rich colors and an interesting scene.  I like the post in the foreground, but what is really cool about this shot is the contrail pointing straight at the moon.  Nice catch.', '2006-11-02 09:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988579, 418067, 26001, '<td valign="top">wow!!!</td>', 'wow!!!', '2006-11-02 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988580, 417350, 30508, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a frame you''ve got there, and you''ll probably get dinged for it by most voters.  It does look cool though.  As for the shot, the sky is great and I like the sillouhettes of the reeds.  The border is a bit distracting though as it makes it hard to keep my focus on the photo.</td>', 'That''s quite a frame you''ve got there, and you''ll probably get dinged for it by most voters.  It does look cool though.  As for the shot, the sky is great and I like the sillouhettes of the reeds.  The border is a bit distracting though as it makes it hard to keep my focus on the photo.', '2006-11-02 09:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988582, 420127, 30508, '<td valign="top">I really love the washed out look of this. It gives it a real nostalgic feel.  I''d bet your getting comments on it being overexposed, but I think that''s the point of this shot.  It really accentuates the textures of the bricks and leaves.</td>', 'I really love the washed out look of this. It gives it a real nostalgic feel.  I''d bet your getting comments on it being overexposed, but I think that''s the point of this shot.  It really accentuates the textures of the bricks and leaves.', '2006-11-02 09:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988598, 419525, 26001, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a little more saturation and contrast. i like this one too though.</td>', 'I would have preferred a little more saturation and contrast. i like this one too though.', '2006-11-02 09:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988600, 420206, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition with strong vertical lines.  However, it seems to have a green color cast to it.  Not sure if that was intentional but it is a little distracting.</td>', 'This is a great composition with strong vertical lines.  However, it seems to have a green color cast to it.  Not sure if that was intentional but it is a little distracting.', '2006-11-02 09:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988612, 418310, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very well composed.  The eye is drawn up into the frame by the waterfall in the foreground, let through the great colorful reflections in the pool, and then left to rest on the waterfall in the background.  The nice greens on the log to the right frame this wonderfully.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very well composed.  The eye is drawn up into the frame by the waterfall in the foreground, let through the great colorful reflections in the pool, and then left to rest on the waterfall in the background.  The nice greens on the log to the right frame this wonderfully.  Nice job.', '2006-11-02 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988614, 418471, 34192, '<td valign="top">This was the only 10 I found in the challenge.  Does that reflect on me or on the entries?  Excellent work BTW. :)</td>', 'This was the only 10 I found in the challenge.  Does that reflect on me or on the entries?  Excellent work BTW. :)', '2006-11-02 10:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988618, 417545, 45375, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this follows the challenge, it seems like more of a portrait than a landscape shot to me.</td>', 'I don''t think this follows the challenge, it seems like more of a portrait than a landscape shot to me.', '2006-11-02 10:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988628, 420964, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful, evocative photo.  I love the color choice for this, and the clouds and the mist complement each other perfectly.</td>', 'This is a wonderful, evocative photo.  I love the color choice for this, and the clouds and the mist complement each other perfectly.', '2006-11-02 10:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988631, 418838, 26001, '<td valign="top">very beautiful and serene. very good choice of "glow/dreamy" effect.</td>', 'very beautiful and serene. very good choice of "glow/dreamy" effect.', '2006-11-02 10:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988632, 420653, 32147, '<td valign="top">great low angle shot.</td>', 'great low angle shot.', '2006-11-02 10:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988636, 420444, 32147, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.</td>', 'excellent composition.', '2006-11-02 10:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988637, 419305, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines and great, rich colors.  Just a nit, but there seems to be a large dust spot just to the right of the top of the tree which could have been removed given that this was advanced editing.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines and great, rich colors.  Just a nit, but there seems to be a large dust spot just to the right of the top of the tree which could have been removed given that this was advanced editing.', '2006-11-02 10:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988639, 419445, 26001, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.', '2006-11-02 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988646, 420029, 30508, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  Love the colors in the sky and the subtle details in the sand and on the boat.  Perfectly exposed.  My only minor criticism would be that there are a few artifacts in the sky, possibly from over saturating.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  Love the colors in the sky and the subtle details in the sand and on the boat.  Perfectly exposed.  My only minor criticism would be that there are a few artifacts in the sky, possibly from over saturating.', '2006-11-02 10:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988650, 419287, 32147, '<td valign="top">what a clever shot!  9</td>', 'what a clever shot!  9', '2006-11-02 10:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988652, 421008, 30508, '<td valign="top">The colors seem to be a little over saturated and the blown out sky is a little distracting.  A graduated ND filter might have helped even out the exposure for you.  I do like the composition as a whole though.</td>', 'The colors seem to be a little over saturated and the blown out sky is a little distracting.  A graduated ND filter might have helped even out the exposure for you.  I do like the composition as a whole though.', '2006-11-02 10:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988662, 419885, 32147, '<td valign="top">very nice, moody shot.</td>', 'very nice, moody shot.', '2006-11-02 10:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988668, 421027, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice sillouhettes and an interesting sky.  This has a feeling of wide open spaces.</td>', 'Nice sillouhettes and an interesting sky.  This has a feeling of wide open spaces.', '2006-11-02 10:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988673, 420491, 32147, '<td valign="top">too bad about the reflections on the window and the spots.  Otherwise, with a little work, this photo would have scored high.</td>', 'too bad about the reflections on the window and the spots.  Otherwise, with a little work, this photo would have scored high.', '2006-11-02 10:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988678, 420684, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful, moody image.  The details on the stones, both in the foreground and background, are nice and sharp.  I live the feel of the water.  The sky does look a little off, but it fits with the feel of the rest of the image.</td>', 'This is a wonderful, moody image.  The details on the stones, both in the foreground and background, are nice and sharp.  I live the feel of the water.  The sky does look a little off, but it fits with the feel of the rest of the image.', '2006-11-02 10:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988683, 419102, 30508, '<td valign="top">The colors and reflections are great and I like the detail in the foreground.</td>', 'The colors and reflections are great and I like the detail in the foreground.', '2006-11-02 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988688, 420983, 30508, '<td valign="top">Spectacular fall colurs.  The layering of this shot works very well and it looks like you were there at just the right time of day.</td>', 'Spectacular fall colurs.  The layering of this shot works very well and it looks like you were there at just the right time of day.', '2006-11-02 10:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988749, 420806, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition.  I think it would be improved if the foreground were in focus.  Then, the lines of the furrows would be more pronounced and better at leading the eye into the rest of the shot.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition.  I think it would be improved if the foreground were in focus.  Then, the lines of the furrows would be more pronounced and better at leading the eye into the rest of the shot.', '2006-11-02 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2988753, 419803, 30508, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little flat and the focus seems a little soft.  Also, the centered placement of the post makes the image feel very static.  I would also recommend placing the horizon higher in the frame, perhaps by getting closer to the post.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little flat and the focus seems a little soft.  Also, the centered placement of the post makes the image feel very static.  I would also recommend placing the horizon higher in the frame, perhaps by getting closer to the post.', '2006-11-02 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
