(2989485, 420645, 62187, '<td valign="top">Cool...you got that airplane looking like it''s headed right for the moon!</td>', 'Cool...you got that airplane looking like it''s headed right for the moon!', '2006-11-02 14:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989490, 417126, 66193, '<td valign="top">intended composition is sound.  However, the DOF isn''t right.  It''s hard to see at this size, but it looks like the only point of focus is the very near end of the log.  You needed to stop the aperture way down, and get the focus point correct so that the log and the bluff in the background are sufficiently in focus as to not detract from the composition.  A tripod would be an absolute must, as your shutter speed in that light at the small aperture would likely be on the order of seconds.  Also, remote shutter release and mirror lock-up (if available on your camera) are also needed.</td>', 'intended composition is sound.  However, the DOF isn''t right.  It''s hard to see at this size, but it looks like the only point of focus is the very near end of the log.  You needed to stop the aperture way down, and get the focus point correct so that the log and the bluff in the background are sufficiently in focus as to not detract from the composition.  A tripod would be an absolute must, as your shutter speed in that light at the small aperture would likely be on the order of seconds.  Also, remote shutter release and mirror lock-up (if available on your camera) are also needed.', '2006-11-02 14:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989491, 419453, 66193, '<td valign="top">A little small, could''ve used the entire 640 pixels (at 72-90 dpi).  A nice capture, although the branch or tree in the bottom distracts.  A graduated ND filter would have also helped balance out the exposure of the sky with the foreground elements.</td>', 'A little small, could''ve used the entire 640 pixels (at 72-90 dpi).  A nice capture, although the branch or tree in the bottom distracts.  A graduated ND filter would have also helped balance out the exposure of the sky with the foreground elements.', '2006-11-02 14:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989492, 420509, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow...hope the other voters aren''t too hard on you...the landscape is kinda vauge...but I like it. 8</td>', 'Wow...hope the other voters aren''t too hard on you...the landscape is kinda vauge...but I like it. 8', '2006-11-02 14:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
