(2989954, 417471, 45818, '<td valign="top">imo, this picture needs a nicer sky. Right now it''s pretty much overlit, and it makes the image harsh. I''ve had some luck with reducing the aperture and postprocessing the image to light it up in circumstances like these... The composition is great.</td>', 'imo, this picture needs a nicer sky. Right now it''s pretty much overlit, and it makes the image harsh. I''ve had some luck with reducing the aperture and postprocessing the image to light it up in circumstances like these... The composition is great.', '2006-11-02 16:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2989968, 420748, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this. I think if it were mine, I''d adjust levels and saturate the reds and yellows to give it more pop.</td>', 'I like the idea of this. I think if it were mine, I''d adjust levels and saturate the reds and yellows to give it more pop.', '2006-11-02 16:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
