(2990003, 421008, 45818, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors (are those the real colors?), but the blown out sky ruins the picture :-(<br/> <br/>This would have been a fantastic candidate for HDR:<br/>   //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_dynamic_range_imaging</td>', 'Amazing colors (are those the real colors?), but the blown out sky ruins the picture :-( This would have been a fantastic candidate for HDR:   //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/High_dynamic_range_imaging', '2006-11-02 16:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990004, 421039, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite of the challenge.  It has more than just one level of interest. In the foreground are those glorious red leaves, then the water and the reflected sky, then the sunset in the background, with more color and texture.  Stunning work.  I''d be proud to hang this on my wall. 10</td>', 'This is probably my favorite of the challenge.  It has more than just one level of interest. In the foreground are those glorious red leaves, then the water and the reflected sky, then the sunset in the background, with more color and texture.  Stunning work.  I''d be proud to hang this on my wall. 10', '2006-11-02 16:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2990009, 419790, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - now that''s a twist.  I like it but I wonder if the "literal" police will kill you on this.  So nice to see originality.  Great image. I like the symmetry. 8</td>', 'WOW - now that''s a twist.  I like it but I wonder if the "literal" police will kill you on this.  So nice to see originality.  Great image. I like the symmetry. 8', '2006-11-02 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
