(2992175, 420568, 59564, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2006-11-03 01:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2992185, 418454, 29904, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly the white of the snow is overexposed.  And the whole shot feels tipped to the right.  Even if it isn''t, it helps to make the viewer feel balanced by evening it out.  Also you don''t want to put your dividing line or horizion line right smack in the middle.  One third from the top or bottom is standard, but just a 10% difference helps.  The shapes on the bottom are nice and add interest.  <br/>Hope that helps :)</td>', 'Unfortunatly the white of the snow is overexposed.  And the whole shot feels tipped to the right.  Even if it isn''t, it helps to make the viewer feel balanced by evening it out.  Also you don''t want to put your dividing line or horizion line right smack in the middle.  One third from the top or bottom is standard, but just a 10% difference helps.  The shapes on the bottom are nice and add interest.  Hope that helps :)', '2006-11-03 01:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
