(2992804, 418580, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I suspect you forgot to sharpen after down sizing this image for the challenge.  This image would also benefit from a little post processing work with levels or curves to boost the detail in the hay bales. With levels, I would suggest dropping the gamma (the middle slider) and then boosting the brightness and contrast.</td>', 'Back to comment: I suspect you forgot to sharpen after down sizing this image for the challenge.  This image would also benefit from a little post processing work with levels or curves to boost the detail in the hay bales. With levels, I would suggest dropping the gamma (the middle slider) and then boosting the brightness and contrast.', '2006-11-03 07:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
