(2993729, 418636, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice color and strong composition.  I love all the vertical lines of the masts pointing up into that rich sky.</td>', 'Nice color and strong composition.  I love all the vertical lines of the masts pointing up into that rich sky.', '2006-11-03 11:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993755, 421107, 30508, '<td valign="top">Good control over the exposure.  Nice details on both sides of the barn and a nice dramatic sky.  This has a nice, pastoral feel to it.</td>', 'Good control over the exposure.  Nice details on both sides of the barn and a nice dramatic sky.  This has a nice, pastoral feel to it.', '2006-11-03 11:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993756, 419268, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot with nice strong colors and fantastic leading lines.  Too bad it is so small.</td>', 'This is a great shot with nice strong colors and fantastic leading lines.  Too bad it is so small.', '2006-11-03 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993757, 419868, 30508, '<td valign="top">The trees in this shot are far more interesting with their strong colors and textures than the sky.  I think featuring more of the trees and less of the sky might have been a better approach with this.</td>', 'The trees in this shot are far more interesting with their strong colors and textures than the sky.  I think featuring more of the trees and less of the sky might have been a better approach with this.', '2006-11-03 11:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993760, 420223, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very cool sky and interesting silhouettes.  The cars in the foreground really don''t add much though.</td>', 'Very cool sky and interesting silhouettes.  The cars in the foreground really don''t add much though.', '2006-11-03 11:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993764, 419029, 30508, '<td valign="top">Well, it is a portrait orientation if I turn my head, but that hurts my neck.  Could also be a little bigger.  It is an interesting composition, though.  I like the branch coming across what should be the top of the frame.</td>', 'Well, it is a portrait orientation if I turn my head, but that hurts my neck.  Could also be a little bigger.  It is an interesting composition, though.  I like the branch coming across what should be the top of the frame.', '2006-11-03 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993766, 418910, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful greens and blues.  I love the composition with the strong foreground elements and the interesting background peeking through the gap in the trees.</td>', 'Beautiful greens and blues.  I love the composition with the strong foreground elements and the interesting background peeking through the gap in the trees.', '2006-11-03 12:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993770, 420868, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  I like the way this is composed, framing the subject nicely.  The color balance feels a bit off, but that may just be me.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  I like the way this is composed, framing the subject nicely.  The color balance feels a bit off, but that may just be me.', '2006-11-03 12:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993774, 420563, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice view.  The composition feels a little too static for me, probably because all of the main points of interest are aligned down the middle.</td>', 'Nice view.  The composition feels a little too static for me, probably because all of the main points of interest are aligned down the middle.', '2006-11-03 12:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993778, 420499, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fall colors and a lovely view.  Looks like you chose a good time of day to take this given the interesting shadows on the fields.</td>', 'Beautiful fall colors and a lovely view.  Looks like you chose a good time of day to take this given the interesting shadows on the fields.', '2006-11-03 12:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993802, 418778, 39427, '<td valign="top">lovely exposure/editing, I imagine it was difficult to get the sky, highlighted trees, and foreground so perfectly balanced.  Great composition, clarity, etc... 9.</td>', 'lovely exposure/editing, I imagine it was difficult to get the sky, highlighted trees, and foreground so perfectly balanced.  Great composition, clarity, etc... 9.', '2006-11-03 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993864, 419474, 30608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise!</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise!', '2006-11-03 12:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993874, 418454, 14735, '<td valign="top">The snow on the mountain is too over exposed.</td>', 'The snow on the mountain is too over exposed.', '2006-11-03 12:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993883, 420494, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the mountain and the tower, but the light is flat and takes detail out of the shot. Perhaps a different time of the day would work better.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the mountain and the tower, but the light is flat and takes detail out of the shot. Perhaps a different time of the day would work better.', '2006-11-03 12:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993897, 417631, 14735, '<td valign="top">The shot is a bit dark in the foreground and the building and the cars in the background are not pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'The shot is a bit dark in the foreground and the building and the cars in the background are not pleasing to the eye.', '2006-11-03 12:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2993925, 419095, 14735, '<td valign="top">This may seem long, but here it goes. I vote first and then add comments later and your''s is the first one I will comment on because of the following. I gave your photo a 7 because of the composition, what I should have given it was a 10. There are two parts to a photo, the taking, and the photo shopping. As far as the taking you did a great job, but, there is light and shadow here that you did not develop. I did a quick redo of this beautiful shot and I would like to send it to you after the challenge is over. The color pops out at you and the light give the photo so much depth. As far as taking photo''s keep up the good work, great comp and detail, but play with your photo shop a bit more, which ever one you us. Nice shot.<br/>P.S. do not respond to this until the voting is over if you feel so inclined</td>', 'This may seem long, but here it goes. I vote first and then add comments later and your''s is the first one I will comment on because of the following. I gave your photo a 7 because of the composition, what I should have given it was a 10. There are two parts to a photo, the taking, and the photo shopping. As far as the taking you did a great job, but, there is light and shadow here that you did not develop. I did a quick redo of this beautiful shot and I would like to send it to you after the challenge is over. The color pops out at you and the light give the photo so much depth. As far as taking photo''s keep up the good work, great comp and detail, but play with your photo shop a bit more, which ever one you us. Nice shot.P.S. do not respond to this until the voting is over if you feel so inclined', '2006-11-03 12:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
