(2994186, 420869, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great minimalist composition. Conveys a good sense of danger from the storms on the Great Lakes. Makes me hear Gordon Lightfoot telling us the story of the Edmund Fitzgerald right now.</td>', 'Great minimalist composition. Conveys a good sense of danger from the storms on the Great Lakes. Makes me hear Gordon Lightfoot telling us the story of the Edmund Fitzgerald right now.', '2006-11-03 14:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
