(2994195, 419432, 64175, '<td valign="top">The image is really to small to see much of the detail. I thin it is a street lined by trees on each side which would be a nice composition if I could see it more clearly.  Sorry.</td>', 'The image is really to small to see much of the detail. I thin it is a street lined by trees on each side which would be a nice composition if I could see it more clearly.  Sorry.', '2006-11-03 14:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
