(2994204, 418315, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice composition. The upper center cloud is slightly overexposed and acts as a viewer distraction. The horizon is not quite level.</td>', 'Good idea and nice composition. The upper center cloud is slightly overexposed and acts as a viewer distraction. The horizon is not quite level.', '2006-11-03 14:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
