(2994226, 420983, 5792, '<td valign="top">The near foreground is a distraction to an otherwise stunning autumn image.</td>', 'The near foreground is a distraction to an otherwise stunning autumn image.', '2006-11-03 14:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
