(2995623, 420685, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice. I might have shot from just a little lower to have the grasses higher and then come in a bit narrower from the left side. Tall features do help the vertical composition.</td>', 'Nice. I might have shot from just a little lower to have the grasses higher and then come in a bit narrower from the left side. Tall features do help the vertical composition.', '2006-11-03 19:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995627, 420206, 43088, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with the jet trail complementing the tree as verticals. Must have used a wide angle.</td>', 'Interesting shot with the jet trail complementing the tree as verticals. Must have used a wide angle.', '2006-11-03 19:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995631, 421096, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection. I think the colors look a bit too saturated for me though.</td>', 'Very nice reflection. I think the colors look a bit too saturated for me though.', '2006-11-03 19:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995634, 420868, 43088, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I would have rather seen the bench more on the left side though.</td>', 'Good idea. I would have rather seen the bench more on the left side though.', '2006-11-03 19:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995637, 420720, 43088, '<td valign="top">Stunning aerial shot!</td>', 'Stunning aerial shot!', '2006-11-03 19:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995641, 420187, 43088, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this seems to lack a subject other than the cloud. There is just nothing of interest here. And you probably already had the slanted horizon mentioned.</td>', 'Unfortunately this seems to lack a subject other than the cloud. There is just nothing of interest here. And you probably already had the slanted horizon mentioned.', '2006-11-03 19:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995651, 418659, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect!</td>', 'Very cool effect!', '2006-11-03 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995659, 420801, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, soft light. Nice mood. 6</td>', 'Beautiful, soft light. Nice mood. 6', '2006-11-03 19:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995660, 419525, 43088, '<td valign="top">Interesting location. I like the contrast between the green island and the weathered rock.</td>', 'Interesting location. I like the contrast between the green island and the weathered rock.', '2006-11-03 19:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995663, 421087, 43088, '<td valign="top">Wow! That is a dramatic sky!</td>', 'Wow! That is a dramatic sky!', '2006-11-03 19:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995670, 420005, 43088, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and composition good with nice verticals but it seems to be all blurry.</td>', 'The colors are nice and composition good with nice verticals but it seems to be all blurry.', '2006-11-03 20:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995677, 420893, 43088, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and great dramatic light. I do find the shadow distracting though.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and great dramatic light. I do find the shadow distracting though.', '2006-11-03 20:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995691, 420806, 43088, '<td valign="top">It is a good attemt but I feel it does not work at all. The mud in the foreground dominates the picture and it is very hard to slog our way through it to get to the town in the background. The focus seems to be on the mud in the middle. Just using the top third of the picture in a landscape crop would have been better (although not qualified then for this challenge).</td>', 'It is a good attemt but I feel it does not work at all. The mud in the foreground dominates the picture and it is very hard to slog our way through it to get to the town in the background. The focus seems to be on the mud in the middle. Just using the top third of the picture in a landscape crop would have been better (although not qualified then for this challenge).', '2006-11-03 20:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995698, 418910, 43088, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-11-03 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995711, 418310, 67758, '<td valign="top">Love the moss and the long exposure.  Very nice!</td>', 'Love the moss and the long exposure.  Very nice!', '2006-11-03 20:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995715, 417083, 43088, '<td valign="top">Might suggest using a larger image. It is easier to see. Seems pretty abstract from here, which is fine, but we can see no clues that it might be raining other than by the title. As far as I can tell, the focus is on the rocks? in the top part of the picture, not on the distance with the tree which is where I would rather see it.</td>', 'Might suggest using a larger image. It is easier to see. Seems pretty abstract from here, which is fine, but we can see no clues that it might be raining other than by the title. As far as I can tell, the focus is on the rocks? in the top part of the picture, not on the distance with the tree which is where I would rather see it.', '2006-11-03 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995720, 420557, 43088, '<td valign="top">Mostly follows rule of thirds, but I do not find an interesting subject in the photo.</td>', 'Mostly follows rule of thirds, but I do not find an interesting subject in the photo.', '2006-11-03 20:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995729, 420827, 43088, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. I am wondering how it would look with the train blured by motion with a slower shutter speed. Maybe a little more color saturation? Must have been a hazy day. The trees are very interesting and so is the composition.</td>', 'Neat shot. I am wondering how it would look with the train blured by motion with a slower shutter speed. Maybe a little more color saturation? Must have been a hazy day. The trees are very interesting and so is the composition.', '2006-11-03 20:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995737, 420168, 43088, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract. Things do not always have to be in sharp focus to be interesting.</td>', 'Cool abstract. Things do not always have to be in sharp focus to be interesting.', '2006-11-03 20:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995743, 420491, 43088, '<td valign="top">It is a beautiful scene and well framed. The reflections from the (train?) window are a bit of a distraction though.</td>', 'It is a beautiful scene and well framed. The reflections from the (train?) window are a bit of a distraction though.', '2006-11-03 20:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995756, 417631, 43088, '<td valign="top">The flowers and clouds are nice. The cars in the background are not helping though. You might have tried a lower angle for the shot to keep them out of it. Always pay attention to the background when you try to compose a picture. That helps me!</td>', 'The flowers and clouds are nice. The cars in the background are not helping though. You might have tried a lower angle for the shot to keep them out of it. Always pay attention to the background when you try to compose a picture. That helps me!', '2006-11-03 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995761, 419868, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors- it just doesn''t do anything for me. Maybe because the sky takes up too much of the image.</td>', 'Nice fall colors- it just doesn''t do anything for me. Maybe because the sky takes up too much of the image.', '2006-11-03 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995771, 418769, 43088, '<td valign="top">Interesting view. It is hard to get much detail through an aircraft window.</td>', 'Interesting view. It is hard to get much detail through an aircraft window.', '2006-11-03 20:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995774, 418806, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-11-03 20:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995776, 420563, 43088, '<td valign="top">The tree on the right kind of intrudes on the picture.</td>', 'The tree on the right kind of intrudes on the picture.', '2006-11-03 20:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995784, 418797, 43088, '<td valign="top">The composition puts the cranes as the focus in the picture - and I just don''t find them that interesting here. The white bar on the right is distracting too. Could you have gotten further out onto the locks- maybe with a boat in the picture? I just think you could have done better.</td>', 'The composition puts the cranes as the focus in the picture - and I just don''t find them that interesting here. The white bar on the right is distracting too. Could you have gotten further out onto the locks- maybe with a boat in the picture? I just think you could have done better.', '2006-11-03 20:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995789, 419208, 43088, '<td valign="top">I''d crop a bit more off the top.</td>', 'I''d crop a bit more off the top.', '2006-11-03 20:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995790, 421005, 43088, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!</td>', 'Very cool shot!', '2006-11-03 20:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995797, 419524, 43088, '<td valign="top">The bottom is so white in tone compared to the top it is harder to get my eye up to see the top. Light is great. I would just crop some more out of the bottom. Say enough to take out most of the dark shadow in the lower left corner.</td>', 'The bottom is so white in tone compared to the top it is harder to get my eye up to see the top. Light is great. I would just crop some more out of the bottom. Say enough to take out most of the dark shadow in the lower left corner.', '2006-11-03 20:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995805, 420185, 43088, '<td valign="top">OOps. Another one entered in the wrong category. That can happen. I think I would lighten this up a bit. The tones are sort of muddy. Cute baby!</td>', 'OOps. Another one entered in the wrong category. That can happen. I think I would lighten this up a bit. The tones are sort of muddy. Cute baby!', '2006-11-03 20:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995813, 418279, 43088, '<td valign="top">The land is too dark and imposing in my opinion.</td>', 'The land is too dark and imposing in my opinion.', '2006-11-03 20:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995815, 420642, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice layering of light, depth, and texture.</td>', 'Nice layering of light, depth, and texture.', '2006-11-03 20:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995820, 418485, 43088, '<td valign="top">I think you have too much sharpening going on.  It really shows up in the buildings.</td>', 'I think you have too much sharpening going on.  It really shows up in the buildings.', '2006-11-03 20:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995826, 420684, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moody shot. Love this.</td>', 'Beautiful moody shot. Love this.', '2006-11-03 20:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995827, 417445, 43088, '<td valign="top">Portrait orientation means that the frame is longer the other way. Nice location though.</td>', 'Portrait orientation means that the frame is longer the other way. Nice location though.', '2006-11-03 20:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2995829, 419459, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, like this one a lot.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, like this one a lot.', '2006-11-03 20:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
