(2997659, 417409, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  The post processing of this looks very harsh.  It appears to have too much contrast and might be over saturated.  However, some of this may be related to the file size of your image, as DPC allows a file size of 150 Kb and you only used 70 Kb.  The less you compress your image (the larger file size), the better the detail visible in the image.  I also find the out of focus waves towards the front of the image to be distracting (unappealing).  This could be related to not using a small aperture (large number) or from not sharpening enough after down sizing your image.</td>', 'Back to comment:  The post processing of this looks very harsh.  It appears to have too much contrast and might be over saturated.  However, some of this may be related to the file size of your image, as DPC allows a file size of 150 Kb and you only used 70 Kb.  The less you compress your image (the larger file size), the better the detail visible in the image.  I also find the out of focus waves towards the front of the image to be distracting (unappealing).  This could be related to not using a small aperture (large number) or from not sharpening enough after down sizing your image.', '2006-11-04 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997664, 419989, 64568, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, the colours are amazing and the moon is such a great surprise, wonderful.</td>', 'Lovely shot, the colours are amazing and the moon is such a great surprise, wonderful.', '2006-11-04 10:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
