(2997801, 419525, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the rock formation in the foreground and the perspective. Also like how the land formation in the background balances off the mass in the foreground. Neat scale, and neat composition. 7</td>', 'Love the rock formation in the foreground and the perspective. Also like how the land formation in the background balances off the mass in the foreground. Neat scale, and neat composition. 7', '2006-11-04 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2997804, 421027, 33947, '<td valign="top">What is that streak of color near the bottom? A trail of dust from a car? I can''t tell, but I don''t care too much. Love the shot. Beautiful light, and good, concise and clean composition. 7</td>', 'What is that streak of color near the bottom? A trail of dust from a car? I can''t tell, but I don''t care too much. Love the shot. Beautiful light, and good, concise and clean composition. 7', '2006-11-04 12:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
