(2998467, 420853, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice!  You could probably even crop a bit more off the bottom; the rock coming out of the trees is a very powerful image and the leafless trees/grass on the bottom left detract from that a little.</td>', 'Nice!  You could probably even crop a bit more off the bottom; the rock coming out of the trees is a very powerful image and the leafless trees/grass on the bottom left detract from that a little.', '2006-11-04 18:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
