(2999181, 418655, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Love the bright green ferns in contrast with the very white water.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Love the bright green ferns in contrast with the very white water.', '2006-11-04 22:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2999182, 421039, 5112, '<td valign="top">I''m speechless!  This is just so beautiful.  If this doesn''t win the blue, I''m throwing rotten eggs at DPC.  I wonder if this has HDR work - if so, it''s a great use of the technology.  In any case, I''d like to know how this image was done.  But outside of technical stuff, it is just a great composition, so clear, yet it has such softness to it.  WOW.  11 from me (if there were an 11).</td>', 'I''m speechless!  This is just so beautiful.  If this doesn''t win the blue, I''m throwing rotten eggs at DPC.  I wonder if this has HDR work - if so, it''s a great use of the technology.  In any case, I''d like to know how this image was done.  But outside of technical stuff, it is just a great composition, so clear, yet it has such softness to it.  WOW.  11 from me (if there were an 11).', '2006-11-04 22:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
