(3000966, 419469, 64321, '<td valign="top">Nice framing. I like the untouched tree on the right. The blurred embers give it lots of movement.  The colours of the embers are also really nice, rich and saturated.</td>', 'Nice framing. I like the untouched tree on the right. The blurred embers give it lots of movement.  The colours of the embers are also really nice, rich and saturated.', '2006-11-05 09:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
