(3005154, 419268, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  This image is much smaller than what is allowed for a challenge.  The longest side of your image should be 640 pixels.  When your image is this small, it is hard to see the details and judge the quality of the image.  Because of that, many people will give a low vote and move on without really looking.</td>', 'Back to comment:  This image is much smaller than what is allowed for a challenge.  The longest side of your image should be 640 pixels.  When your image is this small, it is hard to see the details and judge the quality of the image.  Because of that, many people will give a low vote and move on without really looking.', '2006-11-06 07:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005160, 417126, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  This image is smaller than what is allowed for a challenge.  The longest side of your image should be 640 pixels.  When your image is this small, it is hard to see the details and judge the quality of the image.  Because of that, many people will give a low vote and move on without really looking.</td>', 'Back to comment:  This image is smaller than what is allowed for a challenge.  The longest side of your image should be 640 pixels.  When your image is this small, it is hard to see the details and judge the quality of the image.  Because of that, many people will give a low vote and move on without really looking.', '2006-11-06 07:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005169, 419223, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  This image appears to not be sharply in focus.  You need to sharpen more after down sizing for the challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  I also think this image would have been better if you would have taken it when the sun was lower.  This would have allowed more detail in the bridge to show and made the sky less harsh to look at.</td>', 'Back to comment:  This image appears to not be sharply in focus.  You need to sharpen more after down sizing for the challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  I also think this image would have been better if you would have taken it when the sun was lower.  This would have allowed more detail in the bridge to show and made the sky less harsh to look at.', '2006-11-06 07:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005170, 420684, 66635, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I would call this a landscape.  But it sure is a fine piece of work.</td>', 'Not sure if I would call this a landscape.  But it sure is a fine piece of work.', '2006-11-06 07:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005179, 420491, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  This image is much smaller than what is allowed for a challenge.  The longest side of your image should be 640 pixels.  When your image is this small, it is hard to see the details and judge the quality of the image.  Because of that, many people will give a low vote and move on without really looking.  I like the scene you choose but would have like to have seen all of the tree on the right side of the image to help balance the composition.</td>', 'Back to comment:  This image is much smaller than what is allowed for a challenge.  The longest side of your image should be 640 pixels.  When your image is this small, it is hard to see the details and judge the quality of the image.  Because of that, many people will give a low vote and move on without really looking.  I like the scene you choose but would have like to have seen all of the tree on the right side of the image to help balance the composition.', '2006-11-06 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005182, 417545, 61679, '<td valign="top">This does not meet the challenge description, as it is not a landscape.  As for the image itself, you may want to sharpen the image a bit more after down sizing for the challenge.  .  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.</td>', 'This does not meet the challenge description, as it is not a landscape.  As for the image itself, you may want to sharpen the image a bit more after down sizing for the challenge.  .  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.', '2006-11-06 07:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005192, 417693, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  You found some nice fall colors to shoot; however, the subject matter is not very captivating to look at.  The power lines and the dead tree up front distract from the appearance of the colors and are not pleasant to look at.  This image also looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.</td>', 'Back to comment:  You found some nice fall colors to shoot; however, the subject matter is not very captivating to look at.  The power lines and the dead tree up front distract from the appearance of the colors and are not pleasant to look at.  This image also looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.', '2006-11-06 07:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005197, 417631, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  An interesting take on the challenge, shooting nature against an urban background.  However, the lighting on the flowers is really not that good, as the flowers tend to blend into the background.  Even if the flowers would have been shot during a different time a day with better light, the subject you choose still would not have scored very well at DPC for it is not all that interesting in itself.</td>', 'Back to comment:  An interesting take on the challenge, shooting nature against an urban background.  However, the lighting on the flowers is really not that good, as the flowers tend to blend into the background.  Even if the flowers would have been shot during a different time a day with better light, the subject you choose still would not have scored very well at DPC for it is not all that interesting in itself.', '2006-11-06 07:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005200, 420734, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: This image also looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.</td>', 'Back to comment: This image also looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.', '2006-11-06 07:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005203, 418297, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  An uninteresting subject and awkward looking crop.  The image could also use some more contrast and saturation to give it more depth.</td>', 'Back to comment:  An uninteresting subject and awkward looking crop.  The image could also use some more contrast and saturation to give it more depth.', '2006-11-06 07:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005207, 418922, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Not what the voters will be looking for subject wise in this challenge.  You did a pretty good job keeping detail in the fire but all in all, an uninteresting subject to look at.</td>', 'Back to comment: Not what the voters will be looking for subject wise in this challenge.  You did a pretty good job keeping detail in the fire but all in all, an uninteresting subject to look at.', '2006-11-06 07:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005215, 419294, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: This image looks a bit out of focus.  This could be from hand holding the camera during a long exposure or you may need to sharpen more after down sizing the image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  I would have cropped this image a bit tighter to get rid of the partial tree on the left edge and to remove the bright light on the right edge.</td>', 'Back to comment: This image looks a bit out of focus.  This could be from hand holding the camera during a long exposure or you may need to sharpen more after down sizing the image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  I would have cropped this image a bit tighter to get rid of the partial tree on the left edge and to remove the bright light on the right edge.', '2006-11-06 07:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005217, 419118, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  I''m betting you are getting killed on this image, as it doesn''t really meet the subject expectations most voters will have.  The post processing work is very nice and the perpective is very interesting.</td>', 'Back to comment:  I''m betting you are getting killed on this image, as it doesn''t really meet the subject expectations most voters will have.  The post processing work is very nice and the perpective is very interesting.', '2006-11-06 07:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005227, 419109, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: This image looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  As for the composition of the image, the two dark blurs (cows I think - one in the foreground and one mid-image on the right) are really distracting and actully ruin what little interest this image has.  The dried grass is not a very exciting subject to start with and the shallow depth of field does nothing to enhance it.  Sorry if my comments come across as brutal but this image is not very good.</td>', 'Back to comment: This image looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  As for the composition of the image, the two dark blurs (cows I think - one in the foreground and one mid-image on the right) are really distracting and actully ruin what little interest this image has.  The dried grass is not a very exciting subject to start with and the shallow depth of field does nothing to enhance it.  Sorry if my comments come across as brutal but this image is not very good.', '2006-11-06 07:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005231, 417911, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  I''m betting your score is prettly low on this entry, as the subject matter does not really align with the expectations for a landscape challenge.  The post processing work does give it an artsy kind of look but I wonder if you shot the image with this in mind or if you were forced to process it this way to fix an image with blown highlights.</td>', 'Back to comment:  I''m betting your score is prettly low on this entry, as the subject matter does not really align with the expectations for a landscape challenge.  The post processing work does give it an artsy kind of look but I wonder if you shot the image with this in mind or if you were forced to process it this way to fix an image with blown highlights.', '2006-11-06 07:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005234, 420597, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Nice colors but the image looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  I also find the subject matter to hold little interest for me.  A tree centered in an image shows little creativity.</td>', 'Back to comment: Nice colors but the image looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  I also find the subject matter to hold little interest for me.  A tree centered in an image shows little creativity.', '2006-11-06 07:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005237, 419287, 61679, '<td valign="top">Basck to comment:  Not sure what to say about this image.  There is considerable noise and the focus looks a bit soft.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  This image might have more impact if it were post process such that the cows and silo were completely in silhouette.</td>', 'Basck to comment:  Not sure what to say about this image.  There is considerable noise and the focus looks a bit soft.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.  This image might have more impact if it were post process such that the cows and silo were completely in silhouette.', '2006-11-06 07:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005238, 417729, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Not what the voters will be looking for subject wise in this challenge. This image also looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.</td>', 'Back to comment: Not what the voters will be looking for subject wise in this challenge. This image also looks a bit out of focus.  You may want to sharpen more after down sizing an image for a challenge.  Most people use Unsharp Mask to bring back the sharpness lost because of down sizing.', '2006-11-06 07:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005242, 420061, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Not what the voters will be looking for subject wise in this challenge. Although the perspective is somewhat interesting, the subject itself has little appeal visually.  I would be interested in knowing if the person in the upper right is real or part of the exhibit.</td>', 'Back to comment: Not what the voters will be looking for subject wise in this challenge. Although the perspective is somewhat interesting, the subject itself has little appeal visually.  I would be interested in knowing if the person in the upper right is real or part of the exhibit.', '2006-11-06 07:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005249, 420157, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  You have some nice colors in this image but the overall image would have been nicer to look at if the sun had been below the horizon.  As is, the sun is a bit harsh to look at and with only sky and water as subject, this is an average looking sunset at best.</td>', 'Back to comment:  You have some nice colors in this image but the overall image would have been nicer to look at if the sun had been below the horizon.  As is, the sun is a bit harsh to look at and with only sky and water as subject, this is an average looking sunset at best.', '2006-11-06 08:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005467, 420648, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice urban landscape shot, good luck</td>', 'Nice urban landscape shot, good luck', '2006-11-06 09:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
