(3005472, 420801, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the softness</td>', 'Like the softness', '2006-11-06 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005751, 420961, 67723, '<td valign="top">i don''t like the power pole in the composition  nice sky otherwise</td>', 'i don''t like the power pole in the composition  nice sky otherwise', '2006-11-06 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005858, 420693, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The reflection looks like an impressionistic painting.  Great colors and nice strong composition.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The reflection looks like an impressionistic painting.  Great colors and nice strong composition.', '2006-11-06 11:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005867, 420063, 30508, '<td valign="top">The sky doesn''t really have enough interest to devote more than half of the image to it.  I would recommend getting closer so we can see more of the details around the rocks and let the sky just be a backdrop.</td>', 'The sky doesn''t really have enough interest to devote more than half of the image to it.  I would recommend getting closer so we can see more of the details around the rocks and let the sky just be a backdrop.', '2006-11-06 11:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005875, 421085, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great color and strong lines.  Very nicely composed.  The details on the crop are a little hard to make out, but I bet this looks great in real size.</td>', 'Great color and strong lines.  Very nicely composed.  The details on the crop are a little hard to make out, but I bet this looks great in real size.', '2006-11-06 11:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005880, 420726, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  I love the way the stream guides the eye right into the lush forest.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  I love the way the stream guides the eye right into the lush forest.', '2006-11-06 11:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005881, 420970, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great glassy relfection.  What a nice subject you found.  I think this works really well with the leaves framing the bridge.</td>', 'Great glassy relfection.  What a nice subject you found.  I think this works really well with the leaves framing the bridge.', '2006-11-06 11:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005888, 421042, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the foliage and sky.  Nice sweeping curve of the road gives this a strong dynamic feel.  Some of the colors on the leaves look a little blown, perhaps a bit too saturated?</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the foliage and sky.  Nice sweeping curve of the road gives this a strong dynamic feel.  Some of the colors on the leaves look a little blown, perhaps a bit too saturated?', '2006-11-06 11:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005892, 420631, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice, peaceful composition.  I wish the fountain stood out a little more, perhaps a bit of extra local contrast might help with that.  There also looks to be a couple dust spots in the sky that you could have removed given that this was advanced editing.</td>', 'Nice, peaceful composition.  I wish the fountain stood out a little more, perhaps a bit of extra local contrast might help with that.  There also looks to be a couple dust spots in the sky that you could have removed given that this was advanced editing.', '2006-11-06 11:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005900, 420751, 30508, '<td valign="top">Very moody.  I like the rich green lawn, deep shadows, and subtle colors of the leaves.  There does seem to be a little banding in the sky, perhaps from a gradient fill?</td>', 'Very moody.  I like the rich green lawn, deep shadows, and subtle colors of the leaves.  There does seem to be a little banding in the sky, perhaps from a gradient fill?', '2006-11-06 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005914, 418948, 30508, '<td valign="top">I love the wide angle composition.  The puddle with reflection in the foreground along witht he nice details on the rock contrast nicely with the smooth sky.  The waterline in the background does look a little off kilter, but the trees look perfectly vertical, so maybe that''s just a result of the wide angle.</td>', 'I love the wide angle composition.  The puddle with reflection in the foreground along witht he nice details on the rock contrast nicely with the smooth sky.  The waterline in the background does look a little off kilter, but the trees look perfectly vertical, so maybe that''s just a result of the wide angle.', '2006-11-06 11:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005921, 418454, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  The reflection seems a little too dark give just how bright the snow on the mountain is.  A little more balance in the exposure would really make this pop.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  The reflection seems a little too dark give just how bright the snow on the mountain is.  A little more balance in the exposure would really make this pop.', '2006-11-06 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005925, 418036, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The clouds in the sky really balance all the rich detail in the foreground.  I also love hay bale shots.  And the duotone gives this a nice nostalgic feel.</td>', 'Nice.  The clouds in the sky really balance all the rich detail in the foreground.  I also love hay bale shots.  And the duotone gives this a nice nostalgic feel.', '2006-11-06 12:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005928, 420735, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  The foreground detail helps draw the eye in.  The blown out sky is a bit of a distraction, though.  A graduated ND filter can help with that.</td>', 'Nice colors.  The foreground detail helps draw the eye in.  The blown out sky is a bit of a distraction, though.  A graduated ND filter can help with that.', '2006-11-06 12:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005938, 418930, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the strong sky and nice leading lines.  But the lines lead into that dark shadow which lacks any detail to hold onto the eye.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the strong sky and nice leading lines.  But the lines lead into that dark shadow which lacks any detail to hold onto the eye.', '2006-11-06 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005942, 419287, 30508, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I love the soft feel of the background, but the silhouette really needs to be sharp to be effective.</td>', 'Great idea!  I love the soft feel of the background, but the silhouette really needs to be sharp to be effective.', '2006-11-06 12:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005944, 417052, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice.  This is a good use of the portrait orientation.  The colors and lines work really well.</td>', 'Nice.  This is a good use of the portrait orientation.  The colors and lines work really well.', '2006-11-06 12:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005946, 420745, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors, and I like the ocean fog effect.  the way the top of the cliff coincides with the horizon line is a little unsettling for some reason though.  You probably couldn''t do this (at least not with some rope :D) but taking this from a slightly lower perspective would really give the cliff some impact.</td>', 'Nice rich colors, and I like the ocean fog effect.  the way the top of the cliff coincides with the horizon line is a little unsettling for some reason though.  You probably couldn''t do this (at least not with some rope :D) but taking this from a slightly lower perspective would really give the cliff some impact.', '2006-11-06 12:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005949, 418964, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice and peaceful.  I like how you''ve captured the rays of light from the setting sun.</td>', 'Nice and peaceful.  I like how you''ve captured the rays of light from the setting sun.', '2006-11-06 12:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005953, 418434, 30508, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the rocks in the foreground and the way the street leads the eye into the frame.  I also like the repeating pattern of the lights, but the lead right to the one on the left which is cut off.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the rocks in the foreground and the way the street leads the eye into the frame.  I also like the repeating pattern of the lights, but the lead right to the one on the left which is cut off.', '2006-11-06 12:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005956, 420563, 57936, '<td valign="top">The white border really hurts the image. Otherwise, it seems just a touch soft.</td>', 'The white border really hurts the image. Otherwise, it seems just a touch soft.', '2006-11-06 12:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005958, 419041, 30508, '<td valign="top">This has a very bleak feel to it, but the deep blue of the sky kind of detracts from that.</td>', 'This has a very bleak feel to it, but the deep blue of the sky kind of detracts from that.', '2006-11-06 12:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005959, 419456, 57936, '<td valign="top">Love the foreground detail and the curves of water and shoreline! Bravo!!!!</td>', 'Love the foreground detail and the curves of water and shoreline! Bravo!!!!', '2006-11-06 12:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3005962, 417562, 30508, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the black and white treatment of this.  The foreground is a little too plain to get so much real estate, though, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the black and white treatment of this.  The foreground is a little too plain to get so much real estate, though, in my opinion.', '2006-11-06 12:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
