(3010297, 419993, 67240, '<td valign="top">Sorry if I sound like monday-morning QB...<br/> <br/>Would have been really nice if you got a lower perspective so that the stream really came out of the bottom of the image. Also, move the person closer to make them the main subject and the viewer can see what he is doing. Last minor thing is to get rid of the car on the left.</td>', 'Sorry if I sound like monday-morning QB... Would have been really nice if you got a lower perspective so that the stream really came out of the bottom of the image. Also, move the person closer to make them the main subject and the viewer can see what he is doing. Last minor thing is to get rid of the car on the left.', '2006-11-07 12:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3010306, 420938, 67240, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look sharp.</td>', 'Doesn''t look sharp.', '2006-11-07 12:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3010315, 420736, 67240, '<td valign="top">So simple. I like it.</td>', 'So simple. I like it.', '2006-11-07 12:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
