(3014073, 418297, 45790, '<td valign="top">Be aware in the future that your picture would be disqualified for stitching multiple images (check out the rules). Interesting idea, using a vertical panorama, though. I expect you adjusted the focus at each position, giving the effect of a tilt/shift lens, but that might have made the stitching more difficult. I''m going to have to try this out myself!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-08 20:29:12.</i></td>', 'Be aware in the future that your picture would be disqualified for stitching multiple images (check out the rules). Interesting idea, using a vertical panorama, though. I expect you adjusted the focus at each position, giving the effect of a tilt/shift lens, but that might have made the stitching more difficult. I''m going to have to try this out myself!', '2006-11-08 11:17:25.000000', '2006-11-08 20:29:12.000000', 0),
