(3014281, 420748, 24454, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites.  I do not understand the 5.7!  It''s stunning in every way!   I love those tiny little deer and the perspective it gives to this massive scene!</td>', 'This was one of my favorites.  I do not understand the 5.7!  It''s stunning in every way!   I love those tiny little deer and the perspective it gives to this massive scene!', '2006-11-08 12:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3014283, 417472, 40819, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone, my highest score and placement ever. This was shot on the Day of the 75th anniversary of the opening of the George Washington Bridge between Fort Lee New Jersey and the Manhattan borough of New York City. <br/> <br/>Thank you all for your kind words and high scores.<br/> <br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Thank you everyone, my highest score and placement ever. This was shot on the Day of the 75th anniversary of the opening of the George Washington Bridge between Fort Lee New Jersey and the Manhattan borough of New York City.  Thank you all for your kind words and high scores. Mike', '2006-11-08 12:14:17.000000', NULL, 0);
