(3021444, 417472, 40819, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Structor:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on your top 10 finish. This is a great shot of bridge, but where are the Landscape? </i></td></tr></table>Obviously someone saw one otherwise I don''t think it would have scored so high. But seriously folks, there is land on the other side of the river.</td>', 'Originally posted by Structor: Congratulations on your top 10 finish. This is a great shot of bridge, but where are the Landscape? Obviously someone saw one otherwise I don''t think it would have scored so high. But seriously folks, there is land on the other side of the river.', '2006-11-11 02:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3021476, 418580, 63972, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments... However, I don''t necessarily agree with some of them, but totally respect your views. Nothing much to say for the person who gave a 0 for overall opinion, a 2 for meeting the challenge (thanks!) and a bunch of 1''s though. <br/> <br/>Anyways, this was an abstractish approach, so I was not expecting a very high point. Actually, I''m impressed with a point higher than 5.  Well, I was not very happy with a couple of things myself, so I''ll edit it again based on some of the comments and put a print of it in my office.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments... However, I don''t necessarily agree with some of them, but totally respect your views. Nothing much to say for the person who gave a 0 for overall opinion, a 2 for meeting the challenge (thanks!) and a bunch of 1''s though.  Anyways, this was an abstractish approach, so I was not expecting a very high point. Actually, I''m impressed with a point higher than 5.  Well, I was not very happy with a couple of things myself, so I''ll edit it again based on some of the comments and put a print of it in my office.', '2006-11-11 03:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
