(3180472, 419469, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I like the sparks, the silhouette in the lower left, and foliage in the background.  Fire is a good subject, but often difficult to shoot -- you''ve done pretty well here, and it would have scored better in a better matching challenge.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I like the sparks, the silhouette in the lower left, and foliage in the background.  Fire is a good subject, but often difficult to shoot -- you''ve done pretty well here, and it would have scored better in a better matching challenge.', '2007-01-04 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
