(3679256, 418797, 67671, '<td valign="top">My 2nd challenge is my second highest rated photo, and my third challenge is my third highest rated photo, so I guess I would have to go with my first ever challenge, which scored 6%.  Judging will not be as strait forward, as the subjects will all be different, so I would suggest the original challenge title should be included in the title, may be the date as well,  re-shooting the same scene, could be difficult for some, even impossible, taken on holiday for instance, or a building that has since been demolished, is there a way round this, in my case the first challenge, scored low, because of the chosen subject, I would still give it a go though, try and get it from a different angle, be fun I think.</td>', 'My 2nd challenge is my second highest rated photo, and my third challenge is my third highest rated photo, so I guess I would have to go with my first ever challenge, which scored 6%.  Judging will not be as strait forward, as the subjects will all be different, so I would suggest the original challenge title should be included in the title, may be the date as well,  re-shooting the same scene, could be difficult for some, even impossible, taken on holiday for instance, or a building that has since been demolished, is there a way round this, in my case the first challenge, scored low, because of the chosen subject, I would still give it a go though, try and get it from a different angle, be fun I think.', '2007-05-22 11:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
