(3999859, 417363, 40355, '<td valign="top">I really like this as an example of an excellent landscape that doesn''t need to be blindingly vibrant.  The muted tones and color have an incredible range and blend smoothly, giving it an extra punch of emotion - soft and quiet.  I''m a big fan of the composition, as well, although I might have added just a hair more grass at the bottom, so the verticle posts didn''t seem quite so crowded against the bottom edge.</td>', 'I really like this as an example of an excellent landscape that doesn''t need to be blindingly vibrant.  The muted tones and color have an incredible range and blend smoothly, giving it an extra punch of emotion - soft and quiet.  I''m a big fan of the composition, as well, although I might have added just a hair more grass at the bottom, so the verticle posts didn''t seem quite so crowded against the bottom edge.', '2007-08-15 08:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4010488, 420720, 46870, '<td valign="top">WOw so beautiful .&gt;.LOVE IT:)</td>', 'WOw so beautiful .>.LOVE IT:)', '2007-08-19 06:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037462, 419847, 30807, '<td valign="top">What a cracker! (that''s English for ''great'' in case....)<br/> <br/>Weirdly, there seems to be a face to the right in the water, with an open mouth, red lips, and lots of big teeth. Reminds of the film ''Mask'', but yellowy, not green.<br/> <br/>I love the American Scenery - you have such a lot, and what variety<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I live in England, and cannot afford to travel to the States, but would love to come and visit some of these beautiful places.<br/> <br/>Congrats, and best of luck for the future!</td>', 'What a cracker! (that''s English for ''great'' in case....) Weirdly, there seems to be a face to the right in the water, with an open mouth, red lips, and lots of big teeth. Reminds of the film ''Mask'', but yellowy, not green. I love the American Scenery - you have such a lot, and what variety Unfortunately, I live in England, and cannot afford to travel to the States, but would love to come and visit some of these beautiful places. Congrats, and best of luck for the future!', '2007-08-29 04:07:52.000000', NULL, 0),
