(4489307, 418593, 74559, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, the colors are incredible! It really does look like the sun is rising above the horizon, which cannot be so since Malibu is on the west coast and the sun sets in the west, it doesn''t rise in the west :-) I''d love to know what was responsible for this image appearing the way it does in a west coast sunrise!</td>', 'Beautiful image, the colors are incredible! It really does look like the sun is rising above the horizon, which cannot be so since Malibu is on the west coast and the sun sets in the west, it doesn''t rise in the west :-) I''d love to know what was responsible for this image appearing the way it does in a west coast sunrise!', '2008-02-15 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4515011, 419235, 64568, '<td valign="top">just wonderful, love the reflection, but also the foreground and horizon make this a complete shot, nice one mate</td>', 'just wonderful, love the reflection, but also the foreground and horizon make this a complete shot, nice one mate', '2008-02-25 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
