(6986818, 419326, 62318, '<td valign="top">If you crop off the top where the blue/white sky is you score would have added another .2 points I think.<br/>Then bring out those leaves on the bottom right, and bam this is 6 material.<br/> <br/>What I am saying is you have a good shot here. Good control of the long shutter.<br/>It is quite splendid if you look around.</td>', 'If you crop off the top where the blue/white sky is you score would have added another .2 points I think.Then bring out those leaves on the bottom right, and bam this is 6 material. What I am saying is you have a good shot here. Good control of the long shutter.It is quite splendid if you look around.', '2013-02-27 00:43:46.000000', NULL, 0);
